器技术","ja":"submit-issue は、ユーザーのリクエストを処理する Axum ハンドラー技術です","ko":"submit-issue는 사용자의 요청을 처리하는 Axum 핸들러 기술입니다","es":"Submit-issue es un skill que gestiona solicitudes de usuario, como preguntas, solicitudes de características y informes de errores, para proyectos de Axum","fr":"Submit-issue est un skill qui gère les demandes des utilisateurs, telles que des questions, des demandes de fonctionnalités et des rapports de bogue, pour les projets Axum","de":"Submit-issue ist ein Skill, der Benutzeranfragen wie Fragen, Funktionsanforderungen und Fehlerberichte für Axum-Projekte verwaltet","pt":"O submit-issue é um manipulador de issues que permite aos usuários enviar perguntas, solicitações de recursos e relatórios de bugs","ru":"submit-issue - это обработчик ошибок, который позволяет пользователям отправлять вопросы, запросы функций и отчеты об ошибках","ar":"submit-issue هو معالج لتقارير الأعطال الذي يسمح للمستخدمين بإرسال الأسئلة وطلبات الميزات وتقارير الأعطال"},"features":{"en":["Determines request type: question, feature request, or bug report","Attempts to answer questions using project documentation from docs/guide/index.md","Supports Connect, gRPC, gRPC-Web, and HTTP protocols via Axum handler","Handles user submissions for the connectrpc-axum project","Reads documentation files in Markdown format (e.g., index.md)"],"zh":["支持 gRPC、gRPC-Web 和 HTTP 协议","集成 Axum 处理器处理用户请求","支持问题、功能请求和 bug 报告的处理","使用项目文档进行问题回答","支持多种请求类型的处理"],"ja":["gRPC、gRPC-Web、HTTP プロトコルのサポート","Axum ハンドラーを使用してユーザーのリクエストを処理","質問、機能リクエスト、バグ報告の処理のサポート","プロジェクト ドキュメントを使用して質問に回答","複数のリクエストタイプの処理のサポート"],"ko":["gRPC, gRPC-Web, HTTP 프로토콜 지원","Axum 핸들러를 사용하여 사용자의 요청을 처리","질문, 기능 요청, 버그 보고의 처리 지원","프로젝트 문서를 사용하여 질문에 답","다양한 요청 유형의 처리 지원"],"es":["Gestión de solicitudes de usuario para proyectos de Axum","Conectividad gRPC, gRPC-Web y HTTP","Determinación del tipo de solicitud (pregunta, solicitud de característica, informe de error)","Respuesta automática utilizando la documentación del proyecto","Compatibilidad con Axum handlers"],"fr":["Gestion des demandes des utilisateurs pour les projets Axum","Connectivité gRPC, gRPC-Web et HTTP","Détermination du type de demande (question, demande de fonctionnalité, rapport de bogue)","Réponse automatique en utilisant la documentation du projet","Compatibilité avec les handlers Axum"],"de":["Verwaltung von Benutzeranfragen für Axum-Projekte","gRPC-, gRPC-Web- und HTTP-Connectivität","Bestimmung des Anfragetyps (Frage, Funktionsanforderung, Fehlerbericht)","Automatische Antwort unter Verwendung der Projektdokumentation","Kompatibilität mit Axum-Handlern"],"pt":["Suporte a gRPC, gRPC-Web e HTTP","Manipulação de perguntas, solicitações de recursos e relatórios de bugs","Integração com documentação do projeto","Análise de tipo de solicitação (pergunta, solicitação de recurso ou relatório de bug)"],"ru":["Поддержка gRPC, gRPC-Web и HTTP","Обработка вопросов, запросов функций и отчетов об ошибках","Интеграция с документацией проекта","Анализ типа запроса (вопрос, запрос функции или отчет об ошибке)"],"ar":["دعم gRPC و gRPC-Web و HTTP","معالجة الأسئلة وطلبات الميزات وتقارير الأعطال","التكامل مع وثائق المشروع","تحليل نوع الطلب (سؤال أو طلب ميزة أو تقرير عطل)"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use submit-issue","what is submit-issue","submit-issue alternative","submit-issue vs gRPC","submit-issue install","submit-issue setup guide","Axum handler for issue tracking","connectrpc-axum project issue submission"],"zh":["submit-issue","Axum 处理器","gRPC","gRPC-Web","HTTP","AIエージェント","项目文档","问题回答"],"ja":["submit-issue","Axum ハンドラー","gRPC","gRPC-Web","HTTP","AIエージェント","プロジェクト ドキュメント","質問回答"],"ko":["submit-issue","Axum 핸들러","gRPC","gRPC-Web","HTTP","AI 에이전트","프로젝트 문서","질문 답변"],"es":["submit-issue","Axum","gRPC","gRPC-Web","HTTP","gestión de solicitudes de usuario","informes de errores","solicitudes de características","documentación de proyectos","conectividad de Axum"],"fr":["submit-issue","Axum","gRPC","gRPC-Web","HTTP","gestion des demandes des utilisateurs","rapports de bogue","demandes de fonctionnalités","documentation de projet","connectivité Axum"],"de":["submit-issue","Axum","gRPC","gRPC-Web","HTTP","Verwaltung von Benutzeranfragen","Fehlerberichte","Funktionsanforderungen","Projektdokumentation","Axum-Connectivität"],"pt":["submit-issue","Axum","gRPC","gRPC-Web","HTTP","manipulador de issues","relatórios de bugs","solicitações de recursos","perguntas"],"ru":["submit-issue","Axum","gRPC","gRPC-Web","HTTP","обработчик ошибок","отчеты об ошибках","запросы функций","вопросы"],"ar":["submit-issue","Axum","gRPC","gRPC-Web","HTTP","معالج لتقارير الأعطال","تقارير الأعطال","طلبات الميزات","الأسئلة"]}},"owner":"washanhanzi","repo":"connectrpc-axum","repoPath":"washanhanzi/connectrpc-axum","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.614Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"submit-issue","description":"Handle user questions, feature requests, and bug reports for connectrpc-axum. This skill should be used when users ask questions about the library, request new features, or report bugs. It first attempts to answer using project documentation, verifies bugs with integration tests, and submits GitHub issues when needed.","bodyPreview":"# Submit Issue\n\nHandle user questions, feature requests, and bug reports for the connectrpc-axum project.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Understand the Request\n\nDetermine the request type:\n- **Question**: User wants to understand how something works\n- **Feature Request**: User wants new functionality\n- **Bug Report**: User believes something is broken\n\n### 2. For Questions - Answer First\n\nBefore suggesting an issue submission, attempt to answer using project documentation:\n\n1. Read `docs/guide/index.md` f","body":"# Submit Issue\n\nHandle user questions, feature requests, and bug reports for the connectrpc-axum project.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Understand the Request\n\nDetermine the request type:\n- **Question**: User wants to understand how something works\n- **Feature Request**: User wants new functionality\n- **Bug Report**: User believes something is broken\n\n### 2. For Questions - Answer First\n\nBefore suggesting an issue submission, attempt to answer using project documentation:\n\n1. Read `docs/guide/index.md` for getting started and features overview\n2. Read `docs/guide/architecture.md` for internal design and module structure\n3. Check other guides in `docs/guide/` for specific topics (configuration, compression, timeouts, etc.)\n4. Reference the connect-go-reference skill for protocol details\n5. Search the codebase for implementation specifics\n\nIf the question can be answered from documentation, provide the answer and ask if more clarification is needed.\n\n### 3. For Bug Reports - Verify First\n\nBefore submitting a bug report:\n\n1. **Reproduce the issue** - Ask user for reproduction steps if not provided\n2. **Run integration tests** - Use the `/test` skill command\n3. **Check connect-go behavior** - Use connect-go-reference skill to verify expected protocol behavior\n4. **Document findings** - Note whether tests pass/fail and any discrepancies\n\nOnly proceed to issue submission if the bug is verified or plausible.\n\n### 4. Submit to GitHub\n\nWhen issue submission is appropriate, use the `gh` CLI:\n\n```bash\n# For bug reports\ngh issue create \\\n  --repo \"frankgreco/connectrpc-axum\" \\\n  --title \"Bug: <concise description>\" \\\n  --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Description\n<what''s broken>\n\n## Steps to Reproduce\n1. <step>\n2. <step>\n\n## Expected Behavior\n<what should happen>\n\n## Actual Behavior\n<what happens instead>\n\n## Environment\n- connectrpc-axum version: <version>\n- Rust version: <version>\n\n## Additional Context\n<test results, connect-go comparison, etc.>\nEOF\n)\"\n\n# For feature requests\ngh issue create \\\n  --repo \"frankgreco/connectrpc-axum\" \\\n  --title \"Feature: <concise description>\" \\\n  --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Description\n<what you want>\n\n## Use Case\n<why you need it>\n\n## Proposed Solution\n<how it might work>\n\n## Alternatives Considered\n<other approaches>\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n### 5. Label Issues Appropriately\n\nAdd labels based on issue type:\n- `bug` - For verified bugs\n- `enhancement` - For feature requests\n- `question` - For questions that need discussion\n- `documentation` - For docs improvements\n\n```bash\ngh issue edit <number> --add-label \"bug\"\n```\n\n## Reference Skills\n\n- **connect-go-reference**: Use to verify protocol behavior against official Go implementation\n- **test**: Use to run integration tests and verify bugs\n\n## Documentation References\n\nWhen answering questions, check these docs in order:\n\n1. `docs/guide/index.md` - Getting started, features, quick start\n2. `docs/guide/architecture.md` - Internal design, module structure, request flow\n3. `docs/guide/configuration.md` - Service and handler configuration\n4. `docs/guide/examples.md` - Code examples and usage patterns\n5. Other topic-specific guides in `docs/guide/` (compression, timeouts, tonic integration, etc.)\n6. Codebase search for implementation details\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:13:18.112Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Support Agents needing streamlined issue submission handling for projects utilizing Axum, gRPC, gRPC-Web, and HTTP protocols.","zh":"适合需要为使用 Axum、gRPC、gRPC-Web 和 HTTP 协议的项目进行简化问题提交处理的支持代理。","ja":"Axum、gRPC、gRPC-Web、および HTTP プロトコルを使用するプロジェクトのためのストリームライン化された問題提出ハンドリングを必要とするサポート エージェントに適しています。","ko":"Axum, gRPC, gRPC-Web 및 HTTP 프로토콜을 사용하는 프로젝트에 대한 문제 제출 처리를 간소화해야 하는 지원 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de soporte que necesitan una gestión de envío de problemas optimizada para proyectos que utilizan Axum, gRPC, gRPC-Web y protocolos HTTP.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de support ayant besoin d''une soumission de problèmes simplifiée pour les projets utilisant Axum, gRPC, gRPC-Web et les protocoles HTTP.","de":"Perfekt für Supportagenten, die eine optimierte Fehlerberichterstellung für Projekte benötigen, die Axum, gRPC, gRPC-Web und HTTP-Protokolle verwenden.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Suporte que precisam de um tratamento de envio de problemas simplificado para projetos que utilizam Axum, gRPC, gRPC-Web e protocolos HTTP.","ru":"Идеально для агентов поддержки, которым требуется упрощенное xử lý отправки проблем для проектов, использующих Axum, gRPC, gRPC-Web и протоколы HTTP.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الدعم الذين يحتاجون إلى معالجة مشكلة مبسطة للرسائل للمشاريع التي تستخدم Axum و gRPC و gRPC-Web وبروتوكولات HTTP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently manage user questions, feature requests, and bug reports by determining request types and providing answers using project documentation, leveraging Axum handler capabilities for Connect, gRPC, gRPC-Web, and HTTP protocols.","zh":"使代理能够通过确定请求类型并使用项目文档提供答案来有效地管理用户问题、功能请求和错误报告，利用 Axum 处理程序的 Connect、gRPC、gRPC-Web 和 HTTP 协议功能。","ja":"エージェントが要求の種類を判断し、プロジェクト文書を使用して回答を提供することで、ユーザーの質問、機能のリクエスト、およびバグの報告を効率的に管理できるようにします。Axum ハンドラーの Connect、gRPC、gRPC-Web、および HTTP プロトコルの機能を活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 요청 유형을 결정하고 프로젝트 문서를 사용하여 답변을 제공함으로써 사용자 질문, 기능 요청 및 버그 보고를 효율적으로 관리할 수 있도록 합니다. Axum 핸들러의 Connect, gRPC, gRPC-Web 및 HTTP 프로토콜 기능을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar de manera eficiente las preguntas de los usuarios, las solicitudes de funciones y los informes de errores determinando los tipos de solicitudes y proporcionando respuestas utilizando la documentación del proyecto, aprovechando las capacidades del controlador Axum para Connect, gRPC, gRPC-Web y protocolos HTTP.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer efficacement les questions des utilisateurs, les demandes de fonctionnalités et les rapports de bogue en déterminant les types de demandes et en fournissant des réponses en utilisant la documentation du projet, en exploitant les capacités du gestionnaire Axum pour Connect, gRPC, gRPC-Web et les protocoles HTTP.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Benutzerfragen, Funktionsanfragen und Fehlerberichte effizient zu verwalten, indem sie die Anfragearten bestimmen und Antworten mittels der Projektdokumentation bereitstellen, indem sie die Axum-Handler-Fähigkeiten für Connect, gRPC, gRPC-Web und HTTP-Protokolle nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar eficientemente as perguntas dos usuários, solicitações de recursos e relatórios de bugs, determinando os tipos de solicitação e fornecendo respostas usando a documentação do projeto, aproveitando as capacidades do Axum handler para Connect, gRPC, gRPC-Web e protocolos HTTP.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно управлять вопросами пользователей, запросами функций и отчетами о багах, определяя типы запросов и предоставляя ответы с использованием документации проекта, используя возможности Axum handler для Connect, gRPC, gRPC-Web и протоколов HTTP.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة أسئلة المستخدمين بطريقة فعالة، وطلبات الميزات و تقارير الأخطاء، من خلال تحديد أنواع الطلبات و توفير الإجابات باستخدام مستندات المشروع، واستخدام إمكانيات معالج Axum لتحويل الاتصال، و gRPC، و gRPC-Web وبروتوكولات HTTP."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating issue submission processes for connectrpc-axum project","Debugging user-reported bugs using gRPC and HTTP protocols","Generating responses to user questions based on project documentation"],"zh":["为 connectrpc-axum 项目自动化问题提交流程","使用 gRPC 和 HTTP 协议调试用户报告的 bug","根据项目文档生成对用户问题的响应"],"ja":["connectrpc-axum プロジェクトの問題提出プロセスを自動化する","gRPC および HTTP プロトコルを使用してユーザーが報告したバグをデバッグする","プロジェクト文書に基づいてユーザーの質問に回答を生成する"],"ko":["connectrpc-axum 프로젝트의 문제 제출 프로세스를 자동화하는 것","gRPC 및 HTTP 프로토콜을 사용하여 사용자가 보고한 버그를 디버깅하는 것","프로젝트 문서를 기반으로 사용자 질문에 대한 응답을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar los procesos de envío de problemas para el proyecto connectrpc-axum","Depurar errores informados por el usuario utilizando gRPC y protocolos HTTP","Generar respuestas a preguntas de los usuarios en función de la documentación del proyecto"],"fr":["Automatiser les processus de soumission de problèmes pour le projet connectrpc-axum","Déboguer les bogues signalés par l''utilisateur en utilisant gRPC et les protocoles HTTP","Générer des réponses aux questions des utilisateurs en fonction de la documentation du projet"],"de":["Automatisieren des Fehlerberichterstellungsprozesses für das connectrpc-axum-Projekt","Fehlerbehebung von benutzerberichteten Fehlern unter Verwendung von gRPC und HTTP-Protokollen","Generieren von Antworten auf Benutzerfragen basierend auf der Projektdokumentation"],"pt":["Automatizar os processos de envio de problemas para o projeto connectrpc-axum","Depurar bugs relatados pelo usuário usando gRPC e protocolos HTTP","Gerar respostas para as perguntas do usuário com base na documentação do projeto"],"ru":["Автоматизировать процессы отправки проблем для проекта connectrpc-axum","Отлаживать ошибки, сообщенные пользователем, используя gRPC и протоколы HTTP","Генерировать ответы на вопросы пользователя на основе документации проекта"],"ar":["تأتمة عمليات إرسال المشكلات لمشروع connectrpc-axum","تصحيح الأخطاء المبلّغة من قبل المستخدم باستخدام gRPC وبروتوكولات HTTP","توليد إجابات للأسئلة التي يطرحها المستخدم بناءً على مستندات المشروع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to project documentation, specifically ''docs/guide/index.md''","Limited to handling issues for the connectrpc-axum project"],"zh":["需要访问项目文档，特别是 ''docs/guide/index.md''","仅限于处理 connectrpc-axum 项目的问题"],"ja":["プロジェクト文書、特に ''docs/guide/index.md'' にアクセスする必要がある","connectrpc-axum プロジェクトの問題のみを処理する"],"ko":["프로젝트 문서, 특히 ''docs/guide/index.md''에 액세스해야 함","connectrpc-axum 프로젝트의 문제만 처리함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la documentación del proyecto, específicamente ''docs/guide/index.md''","Limitado a la gestión de problemas para el proyecto connectrpc-axum"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la documentation du projet, spécifiquement ''docs/guide/index.md''","Limité à la gestion des problèmes pour le projet connectrpc-axum"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Projektdokumentation, insbesondere ''docs/guide/index.md''","Begrenzt auf die Verwaltung von Fehlern für das connectrpc-axum-Projekt"],"pt":["Exige acesso à documentação do projeto, especificamente ''docs/guide/index.md''","Limitado à manipulação de problemas para o projeto connectrpc-axum"],"ru":["Требует доступа к документации проекта, в частности ''docs/guide/index.md''","Ограничен обработкой проблем для проекта connectrpc-axum"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستندات المشروع، تحديداً ''docs/guide/index.md''","محدود بمعالجة المشكلات لمشروع connectrpc-axum"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"81e9feab83656646a307a23e414edaac90105c448ef7a0364432999fd9307dbc","qualityScore":33}');
