INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('Svenja-dev/claude-code-skills/ui-freeze', 'ui-freeze', 'Svenja-dev', 'claude-code-skills', 'community', 'ui-freeze Svenja-dev claude-code-skills community The ui-freeze skill protects critical theme files and important UI components from unintended changes, benefiting B2B SaaS developers. It enforces quality gates and TypeScript, ensuring a stable and consistent design. UI Freeze 是一个自定义的 Claude Code CLI 技能，用于保护设计和主题文件免受意外更改。它支持 Tailwind 配置、TypeScript 和多 LLM 顾问等功能 UI Freeze は、デザインとテーマファイルを意図しない変更から保護するためのカスタム Claude Code CLI スキルです。Tailwind 構成、TypeScript、多 LLM アドバイザーなどの機能をサポートしています UI Freeze는 디자인 및 테마 파일을 의도하지 않은 변경으로부터 보호하기 위한 사용자 지정 Claude Code CLI 스킬입니다. Tailwind 구성, TypeScript 및 다중 LLM 어드바이저 등과 같은 기능을 지원합니다 ui-freeze es una habilidad de Claude Code CLI que protege los archivos de diseño y temas de cambios no deseados en proyectos B2B SaaS ui-freeze est une compétence de Claude Code CLI qui protège les fichiers de conception et de thèmes contre les modifications indésirables dans les projets B2B SaaS ui-freeze ist eine Fähigkeit von Claude Code CLI, die Design- und Theme-Dateien vor unerwünschten Änderungen in B2B-SaaS-Projekten schützt ui-freeze é uma habilidade que protege arquivos de design e tema contra alterações não intencionais, com recursos como TypeScript e multi-LLM advisor ui-freeze - это навык, который защищает файлы дизайна и темы от непреднамеренных изменений, с функциями seperti TypeScript и multi-LLM advisor ui-freeze هو مهارة لحماية ملفات التصميم والموضوع من التغييرات غير المقصودة، مع ميزات مثل TypeScript وmulti-LLM advisor how to use ui-freeze ui-freeze setup guide what is ui-freeze ui-freeze alternative ui-freeze vs competitors ui-freeze install ui-freeze for B2B SaaS development automated quality gates for design files TypeScript enforcement in ui-freeze UI Freeze AI 에이전트 B2B SaaS 设计保护 主题文件保护 Tailwind 配置 TypeScript 多 LLM 顾问 Automatically locks critical theme files like tailwind.config and index.css Warns on changes to important UI components like Header and Footer Enforces TypeScript for consistent and stable design Provides multi-LLM advisor for informed design decisions Protects global styles and CSS variables in files like globals.css and variables.css ui-freeze is a skill that automatically protects design and theme files from unintended changes, locking critical files like tailwind.config and index.css');
