es Urbit runtime interactions for improved performance"],"zh":["支持多种编程语言的 Nock 虚拟机实现","实现了 Noun 表示，包括 Atoms 和树操作","支持 GMP 和自定义 BigInt","提供了 Python、Rust 和 Haskell 的实现示例","实现了运行时优化和评估循环"],"ja":["複数のプログラミング言語に対応した Nock 仮想マシンの実装","Noun 表現を実装，Atoms と木操作を含む","GMP とカスタム BigInt をサポート","Python、Rust、Haskell の実装例を提供","実行時最適化と評価ループを実装"],"ko":["다양한 프로그래밍 언어의 Nock 가상 머신 구현 지원","Noun 표현 구현，Atoms 및 트리 연산 포함","GMP 및 커스텀 BigInt 지원","Python, Rust, Haskell의 구현 예제 제공","실행 시간 최적화 및 평가 루프 구현"],"es":["Implementación de máquinas virtuales Nock en lenguajes como C, Python, Rust y Haskell","Evaluaciones de bucles y operaciones de árboles para optimizar el rendimiento","Uso de bibliotecas como GMP y num-bigint para representar números enteros de precisión arbitraria","Optimización de tiempo de ejecución para mejorar el rendimiento de la aplicación","Compatibilidad con lenguajes de programación como Hoon y Nock"],"fr":["Implémentation de machines virtuelles Nock dans des langages tels que C, Python, Rust et Haskell","Évaluations de boucles et opérations d''arbres pour optimiser les performances","Utilisation de bibliothèques comme GMP et num-bigint pour représenter des nombres entiers à précision arbitraire","Optimisation du temps d''exécution pour améliorer les performances de l''application","Compatibilité avec des langages de programmation tels que Hoon et Nock"],"de":["Implementierung von Nock-Virtuellen Maschinen in Sprachen wie C, Python, Rust und Haskell","Bewertungsschleifen und Baumoperationen zur Optimierung der Leistung","Verwendung von Bibliotheken wie GMP und num-bigint für die Darstellung von Ganzzahlen mit beliebiger Genauigkeit","Laufzeitoptimierung zur Verbesserung der Anwendungsleistung","Kompatibilität mit Programmiersprachen wie Hoon und Nock"],"pt":["Implementação de máquinas virtuais Nock em múltiplas linguagens de programação","Representação de Noun com Atoms e números naturais de precisão arbitrária","Uso de bibliotecas como GMP, num-bigint e bigint para representação de números grandes","Otimização de runtime para melhor desempenho","Suporte a linguagens de programação como C, Python, Rust e Haskell"],"ru":["Реализация виртуальных машин Nock на нескольких языках программирования","Представление Noun с помощью Atoms и натуральных чисел с произвольной точностью","Использование библиотек như GMP, num-bigint и bigint для представления больших чисел","Оптимизация времени выполнения для лучшей производительности","Поддержка языков программирования как C, Python, Rust и Haskell для ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["تنفيذ الآلات الافتراضية Nock في لغات البرمجة المتعددة","تمثيل Noun باستخدام Atoms وأرقام طبيعية ذات دقة تعسفية","استخدام المكتبات مثل GMP و num-bigint و bigint لتمثيل الأرقام الكبيرة","تحسين وقت التشغيل لتحقيق الأداء الأمثل","دعم لغات البرمجة مثل C و Python و Rust و Haskell للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"en":["nock-interpreter-engineer-assistant setup guide","how to implement Nock virtual machine","Urbit runtime optimization techniques","nock-interpreter-engineer-assistant vs alternative solutions","what is nock-interpreter-engineer-assistant","install nock-interpreter-engineer-assistant for AI agents","Hoon and Nock programming language support","nock-interpreter-engineer-assistant for efficient Urbit interactions"],"zh":["Nock 解释器","Urbit 运行时","终端命令","AI 工具","编码问题解决","跨语言实现","Nock 虚拟机","GMP","BigInt","Python","Rust","Haskell"],"ja":["Nock Interpreter","Urbit ランタイム","ターミナルコマンド","AI エージェント","コーディング問題解決","複数言語実装","Nock 仮想マシン","GMP","BigInt","Python","Rust","Haskell"],"ko":["Nock 인터프리터","Urbit 런타임","터미널 명령어","AI 도구","코딩 문제 해결","다중 언어 구현","Nock 가상 머신","GMP","BigInt","Python","Rust","Haskell"],"es":["Agentes de IA","Herramientas de IA","Nock","Máquinas virtuales","Lenguajes de programación","Optimización de rendimiento","GMP","num-bigint","Hoon","Desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["Outils d''IA","Agents d''IA","Nock","Machines virtuelles","Langages de programmation","Optimisation des performances","GMP","num-bigint","Hoon","Développement d''applications"],"de":["KI-Tools","KI-Agents","Nock","Virtuelle Maschinen","Programmiersprachen","Leistungsoptimierung","GMP","num-bigint","Hoon","Anwendungsentwicklung"],"pt":["Nock Interpreter Engineer Assistant","Urbit","Hoon","Nock","máquinas virtuais","linguagens de programação","GMP","num-bigint","bigint","otimização de runtime"],"ru":["Nock Interpreter Engineer Assistant","Urbit","Hoon","Nock","виртуальные машины","языки программирования","GMP","num-bigint","bigint","оптимизация времени выполнения","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["محرك الترجمة Nock Interpreter Engineer Assistant","Urbit","Hoon","Nock","الآلات الافتراضية","لغات البرمجة","GMP","num-bigint","bigint","تحسين وقت التشغيل","الوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"toplyr-narfur","repo":"urbit-skills","repoPath":"toplyr-narfur/urbit-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.662Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nock-interpreter-engineer-assistant","description":"Expert Nock interpreter builder for implementing virtual machines in C, Python, Rust, Haskell, or JavaScript. Use when building Nock interpreters, porting between languages, implementing evaluation loops, or understanding Nock runtime behavior.","bodyPreview":"# Nock Interpreter Engineer\n\nExpert guidance for implementing Nock virtual machines across multiple programming languages with proper evaluation loops, tree operations, and runtime optimization.\n\n## Implementation Architecture\n\n### Core Components\n\n#### 1. Noun Representation\n**Atoms**: Natural numbers with arbitrary precision\n- **C**: GMP (GNU Multiple Precision) or custom BigInt\n- **Python**: Built-in `int` (unlimited precision)\n- **Rust**: `num-bigint` crate or `bigint` crate\n- **Haskell**: `","body":"# Nock Interpreter Engineer\n\nExpert guidance for implementing Nock virtual machines across multiple programming languages with proper evaluation loops, tree operations, and runtime optimization.\n\n## Implementation Architecture\n\n### Core Components\n\n#### 1. Noun Representation\n**Atoms**: Natural numbers with arbitrary precision\n- **C**: GMP (GNU Multiple Precision) or custom BigInt\n- **Python**: Built-in `int` (unlimited precision)\n- **Rust**: `num-bigint` crate or `bigint` crate\n- **Haskell**: `Integer` type (native)\n- **JavaScript**: `BigInt` (ES2020+)\n\n**Cells**: Ordered pairs (cons cells)\n```rust\npub enum Noun {\n    Atom(BigUint),\n    Cell(Box<Noun>, Box<Noun>),\n}\n```\n\n#### 2. Parser & Printer\nParse text format to internal representation:\n```\n[a b c]        -> Cell(Atom(a), Cell(Atom(b), Atom(c)))\n123             -> Atom(123)\n[a [b c]]      -> Cell(Atom(a), Cell(Atom(b), Atom(c)))\n```\n\nPrint back to readable format.\n\n#### 3. Evaluation Loop\nPattern matching on formula opcodes (0-12):\n```python\ndef evaluate(subject, formula):\n    while True:\n        if not is_cell(formula):\n            raise NockCrash(\"formula must be cell\")\n\n        op, rest = formula\n        result = dispatch(op, subject, rest)\n        if is_crash(result):\n            return result\n        subject, formula = result, rest\n        if is_constant(formula):  # Rule 1\n            return formula\n```\n\n## Nock Rules Implementation\n\n### Rule 0: Slot (`[a b] /`)\nBinary tree addressing for efficient axis traversal:\n```\n[subject slot] / = value_at_slot\n```\n\n**Implementation**: Convert slot number to axis path (left/right sequence), traverse subject tree.\n\n### Rule 1: Constant (`[a] *`)\n```\n[subject] * = a\n```\n\nStops evaluation, returns constant `a`.\n\n### Rule 2: Evaluate (`[a b c] +`)\n```\n[subject [a b]] + = [subject a] c\n```\n\nRecurse: evaluate `a` against `subject`, then evaluate result as formula with `c`.\n\n### Rule 3: Cell Test (`[a] ?`)\n```\n[subject a] ? = 0 if a is cell, 1 if a is atom\n```\n\nType discrimination for atoms vs cells.\n\n### Rule 4: Increment (`[a] +`)\n```\n[subject a] + = a + 1\n```\n\nNatural number addition.\n\n### Rule 5: Equality (`[a b] =`)\n```\n[subject a b] = = a b\n```\n\nStructural equality: `0` if identical, `1` if different.\n\n### Rule 6-9: Composition\n- Rule 6: `[[a b] c] /` = `[[a b] / c]`\n- Rule 7: `[a b c] =` = `a b c` (three-element cell)\n- Rule 8: `[a b] +` = `a + b`\n- Rule 9: `[a b] +` = `a + b`\n\nFormulas 2-9 are composites of rules 0-5.\n\n### Rule 10: Edit (`[a b c]`)\n```\n[subject [a b c]] = nock(subject, b)\n```\nTree editing; replaces part of the subject at axis `a`.\n\n### Rule 11: Hint (`[a b]`)\n```\n[subject [a b]] = nock(subject, b)\n```\n\nOptimization hint; evaluates `b` and may use `a` as a hint to the runtime.\n\n### Rule 12: Scry (`[a b] ^`)\n```\n[subject [a b]] ^ = memory[a][b]\n```\n\nReferentially transparent read of memory slot `b` within noun `a`.\n\n## Performance Patterns\n\n### Tail Call Optimization (TCO)\n\nDetect and optimize recursive formulas:\n```python\n# Before: creates stack frames\n[subject [[a b] c]] + = ...\n\n# After: if formula ends with recursive call, reuse stack\nif ends_with_recursive_call(formula):\n    return tco_evaluate(subject, formula)\n```\n\n### Memoization\nCache evaluation results for repeated sub-formulas:\n```python\n_memo = {}\n\ndef memo_evaluate(subject, formula):\n    key = (subject, formula)\n    if key in _memo:\n        return _memo[key]\n    result = evaluate(subject, formula)\n    _memo[key] = result\n    return result\n```\n\n### Lazy Evaluation\nDefer computation until value needed:\n```python\nclass Thunk:\n    def __init__(self, subject, formula):\n        self.subject = subject\n        self.formula = formula\n        self._cached = None\n\n    def force(self):\n        if self._cached is None:\n            self._cached = evaluate(self.subject, self.formula)\n        return self._cached\n```\n\n## Language-Specific Patterns\n\n### C Implementation\n```c\ntypedef struct {\n    mpz_t atom;\n    struct Noun *cell;\n} Noun;\n\nNoun* slot(Noun* subject, Noun* axis);\nNoun* evaluate(Noun* subject, Noun* formula);\n```\n\n**Pros**: Maximum control, pointer efficiency\n**Cons**: Manual memory management, complexity\n\n### Python Implementation\n```python\nfrom typing import Union\n\nNoun = Union[int, tuple]\n\ndef evaluate(subject: Noun, formula: Noun) -> Noun:\n    if not isinstance(formula, tuple):\n        raise NockCrash(\"formula must be cell\")\n    ...\n```\n\n**Pros**: Simplicity, fast prototyping\n**Cons**: Performance overhead\n\n### Rust Implementation\n```rust\npub enum Noun {\n    Atom(BigUint),\n    Cell(Box<Noun>, Box<Noun>),\n}\n\nimpl Noun {\n    pub fn evaluate(&self, formula: &Noun) -> Result<Noun, NockCrash> {\n        match formula {\n            Noun::Cell(op, rest) => dispatch(op, self, rest),\n            _ => Ok(formula.clone()),\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**Pros**: Memory safety, zero-cost abstractions\n**Cons**: Borrow checker complexity\n\n### Haskell Implementation\n```haskell\ndata Noun = Atom Integer | Cell Noun Noun\n\nevaluate :: Noun -> Noun -> Noun\nevaluate subject formula = case formula of\n    Cell (Atom 0, rest) -> slot subject rest\n    Cell (Atom 1, rest) -> rest\n    Cell (Atom 2, Cell(a, Cell(b, c))) -> evaluate (evaluate subject a) c\n    ...\n```\n\n**Pros**: Type safety, pattern matching\n**Cons**: Learning curve\n\n### JavaScript Implementation\n```javascript\nclass Noun {\n    constructor(value) {\n        this.isCell = Array.isArray(value);\n        this.value = value;\n    }\n}\n\nfunction evaluate(subject, formula) {\n    if (!formula.isCell) {\n        throw new NockCrash(\"formula must be cell\");\n    }\n    const [op, ...rest] = formula.value;\n    return dispatch(op, subject, rest);\n}\n```\n\n**Pros**: Web compatibility\n**Cons**: Performance, type safety\n\n## Testing & Validation\n\n### Reference Test: Decrement\n```python\ndef test_decrement():\n    subject = 0\n    formula = [8 [1 0] 8 [1 6 [5 [0 7]] 4 0 6] [0 6] 9 2 [0 2] [4 0 6] 0 7] 9 2 0 1]\n    result = evaluate(subject, formula)\n    assert result == 0, f\"Expected 0, got {result}\"\n```\n\n### Edge Cases\n- **Empty subject**: `[~ [1 0]]` should work\n- **Large atoms**: Test with 64-bit, 128-bit, larger\n- **Deep trees**: Stack overflow prevention\n- **Memory pressure**: Graceful handling, not crash\n\n### Benchmarking\nCompare performance against reference implementations:\n```\nImplementation | Decrement (ms) | Formula 2 (ms) | Memory (MB)\n-------------|-----------------|---------------|--------------\nPython       | 150             | 50             | 25\nRust         | 5               | 0.5            | 3\nC (GMP)     | 1               | 0.1            | 1\n```\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n### 1. Incorrect Slot Calculation\n```\nSlot 1 = axis [0 1]  // Correct\nSlot 2 = axis [1 0]  // Correct, NOT [0 1 1]\n```\n\n### 2. Missing TCO\nDeep recursion crashes stack without trampoline or TCO.\n\n### 3. Inefficient Noun Copying\nDeep clones of nouns create O(n²) behavior. Use reference counting or structural sharing.\n\n### 4. Incorrect Subject Handling\nForgetting to update `subject` after evaluation changes context.\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Nock 4K Specification](https://github.com/urbit/urbit/blob/main/pkg/arvo/sys/zuse.hoon)\n- [nock-interpreter-patterns](../nock-interpreter-patterns/SKILL.md)\n- [nock-multi-language-implementations](../nock-multi-language-implementations/SKILL.md)\n- [nock-specification-reference](../nock-specification-reference/SKILL.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:14:09.065Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Urbit-focused Agents needing expert guidance on Nock virtual machine implementation and optimization.","zh":"非常适合需要在Nock虚拟机实现和优化方面获得专家指导的Urbit专注代理。","ja":"Urbitに焦点を当てたエージェントがNock仮想マシンの実装と最適化についての専門家の指導を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"Nock 가상 머신 구현 및 최적화에 대한 전문가 지침이 필요한 Urbit 중심 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes centrados en Urbit que necesitan orientación experta en implementación y optimización de la máquina virtual Nock.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur Urbit ayant besoin de conseils d''experts sur la mise en œuvre et l''optimisation de la machine virtuelle Nock.","de":"Perfekt für Urbit-fokussierte Agenten, die Expertenratgeber bei der Implementierung und Optimierung der Nock-Virtuellen Maschine benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em Urbit que necessitam de orientação especializada na implementação e otimização da máquina virtual Nock.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на Urbit, которым требуется экспертное руководство по реализации и оптимизации виртуальной машины Nock.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يركزون على Urbit والذين يحتاجون إلى إرشادات خبيرة في تنفيذ وضبط آلة Nock الافتراضية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement Nock virtual machines across multiple programming languages, including proper evaluation loops, tree operations, and runtime optimization using libraries like GMP, num-bigint, and bigint, while supporting languages such as Hoon, Nock, Python, Rust, and Haskell.","zh":"赋予代理在多种编程语言中实现Nock虚拟机的能力，包括正确的评估循环、树操作和使用GMP、num-bigint和bigint等库的运行时优化，同时支持诸如Hoon、Nock、Python、Rust和Haskell等语言。","ja":"GMP、num-bigint、bigintなどのライブラリを使用した評価ループ、ツリー操作、ランタイム最適化を含む、Nock仮想マシンの実装を複数のプログラミング言語で実現するエージェントを可能にします。Hoon、Nock、Python、Rust、Haskellなどの言語をサポートしています。","ko":"GMP, num-bigint, bigint 등의 라이브러리를 사용한 평가 루프, 트리 연산 및 런타임 최적화를 포함하여 여러 프로그래밍 언어에서 Nock 가상 머신을 구현할 수 있는 에이전트를赋予합니다. Hoon, Nock, Python, Rust, Haskell 등의 언어를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar máquinas virtuales Nock en múltiples lenguajes de programación, incluyendo bucles de evaluación adecuados, operaciones de árbol y optimización de tiempo de ejecución utilizando bibliotecas como GMP, num-bigint y bigint, y al mismo tiempo admitiendo lenguajes como Hoon, Nock, Python, Rust y Haskell.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des machines virtuelles Nock sur plusieurs langages de programmation, y compris des boucles d''évaluation appropriées, des opérations d''arbre et une optimisation du temps d''exécution en utilisant des bibliothèques comme GMP, num-bigint et bigint, tout en prenant en charge des langages tels que Hoon, Nock, Python, Rust et Haskell.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Nock-Virtuelle Maschinen über mehrere Programmiersprachen hinweg zu implementieren, einschließlich ordnungsgemäßer Auswerteschleifen, Baumoperationen und Laufzeitoptimierung unter Verwendung von Bibliotheken wie GMP, num-bigint und bigint, und unterstützt gleichzeitig Sprachen wie Hoon, Nock, Python, Rust und Haskell.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar máquinas virtuais Nock em várias linguagens de programação, incluindo laços de avaliação adequados, operações de árvore e otimização de tempo de execução usando bibliotecas como GMP, num-bigint e bigint, além de suportar linguagens como Hoon, Nock, Python, Rust e Haskell.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать виртуальные машины Nock в нескольких языках программирования, включая правильные циклы оценки, операции с деревьями и оптимизацию времени выполнения с помощью библиотек, таких как GMP, num-bigint и bigint, а также поддержку языков, таких как Hoon, Nock, Python, Rust и Haskell.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تنفيذ آلات Nock الافتراضية عبر لغات برمجة متعددة، بما في ذلك الحلقات التقييمية المناسبة والعمليات الشجرية وضبط زمن التشغيل باستخدام مكتبات مثل GMP و num-bigint و bigint، مع دعم لغات مثل Hoon و Nock و Python و Rust و Haskell."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing Nock virtual machines for Urbit development","Optimizing Noun representation using atoms and arbitrary precision integers","Debugging evaluation loops and tree operations in Nock implementations"],"zh":["为Urbit开发实现Nock虚拟机","使用原子和任意精度整数优化名词表示","调试Nock实现中的评估循环和树操作"],"ja":["Urbit開発のためのNock仮想マシンの実装","原子と任意精度整数を使用した名詞表現の最適化","Nock実装での評価ループとツリー操作のデバッグ"],"ko":["Urbit 개발을 위한 Nock 가상 머신 구현","원자 및 임의 정밀도 정수를 사용한 명사 표현 최적화","Nock 구현에서 평가 루프 및 트리 연산 디버깅"],"es":["Implementación de máquinas virtuales Nock para el desarrollo de Urbit","Optimización de la representación de Noun utilizando átomos y enteros de precisión arbitraria","Depuración de bucles de evaluación y operaciones de árbol en implementaciones de Nock"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de machines virtuelles Nock pour le développement d''Urbit","Optimisation de la représentation de Noun en utilisant des atomes et des entiers à précision arbitraire","Débogage des boucles d''évaluation et des opérations d''arbre dans les implementations de Nock"],"de":["Implementierung von Nock-Virtuellen Maschinen für die Entwicklung von Urbit","Optimierung der Noun-Darstellung unter Verwendung von Atomen und beliebig genauen Ganzzahlen","Fehlerbehebung bei Auswerteschleifen und Baumoperationen in Nock-Implementierungen"],"pt":["Implementação de máquinas virtuais Nock para desenvolvimento de Urbit","Otimização da representação de Noun usando átomos e números inteiros de precisão arbitrária","Depuração de loops de avaliação e operações de árvore em implementações de Nock"],"ru":["Реализация виртуальных машин Nock для разработки Urbit","Оптимизация представления Noun с помощью атомов и целых чисел произвольной точности","Отладка циклов оценки и операций с деревьями в реализациях Nock"],"ar":["تنفيذ آلات Nock الافتراضية لتطوير Urbit","تحسين تمثيل Noun باستخدام الذرات والأعداد الصحيحة بدقة تعسفية","تصحيح أخطاء حلقات التقييم والعمليات الشجرية في تنفيذات Nock"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Urbit and its native languages like Hoon and Nock","Limited to Nock virtual machine implementation and optimization"],"zh":["需要了解Urbit及其本地语言，如Hoon和Nock","仅限Nock虚拟机实现和优化"],"ja":["Urbitとそのネイティブ言語であるHoonとNockの知識が必要","Nock仮想マシンの実装と最適化に限定される"],"ko":["Urbit 및 Hoon 및 Nock와 같은 네이티브 언어에 대한 지식이 필요","Nock 가상 머신 구현 및 최적화에 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de Urbit y sus lenguajes nativos como Hoon y Nock","Limitado a la implementación y optimización de la máquina virtual Nock"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance d''Urbit et de ses langages natifs tels que Hoon et Nock","Limité à la mise en œuvre et à l''optimisation de la machine virtuelle Nock"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Urbit und seinen nativen Sprachen wie Hoon und Nock","Begrenzt auf die Implementierung und Optimierung der Nock-Virtuellen Maschine"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de Urbit e suas linguagens nativas, como Hoon e Nock","Limitado à implementação e otimização da máquina virtual Nock"],"ru":["Требует знания Urbit и его родных языков, таких как Hoon и Nock","Ограничен реализацией и оптимизацией виртуальной машины Nock"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة Urbit ولغاتها الأصلية مثل Hoon و Nock","محدود بتنفيذ وضبط آلة Nock الافتراضية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"a1d462af7980fa45c4f06b7e16c7825384ceaba2288988bd89187367a307d919","qualityScore":33}');
