INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('toplyr-narfur/urbit-skills/nock-interpreter-engineer-assistant', 'nock-interpreter-engineer-assistant', 'toplyr-narfur', 'urbit-skills', 'community', 'nock-interpreter-engineer-assistant toplyr-narfur urbit-skills community The nock-interpreter-engineer-assistant skill provides expert guidance for implementing Nock virtual machines, benefiting developers working with Urbit and its native languages like Hoon and Nock. Nock 解释器工程师助手提供了跨语言的 Nock 虚拟机实现方法，解决 Urbit 运行时和终端命令的编码问题 Nock Interpreter Engineer アシスタントは、Urbit ランタイムとターミナルコマンドのコーディング問題を解決するための Nock 仮想マシンの実装方法を提供する Nock 인터프리터 엔지니어 어시스트는 Urbit 런타임과 터미널 명령어의 코딩 문제를 해결하는 Nock 가상 머신의 구현 방법을 제공한다 El asistente de ingeniero de intérprete nock proporciona orientación experta para implementar máquinas virtuales Nock en varios lenguajes de programación. Incluye evaluaciones de bucles, operaciones de árboles y optimización de tiempo de ejecución L''assistant d''ingénieur d''interpréteur nock offre une guidance experte pour implémenter des machines virtuelles Nock dans plusieurs langages de programmation. Il comprend des évaluations de boucles, des opérations d''arbres et une optimisation du temps d''exécution Der nock-Interpreter-Engineer-Assistent bietet Expertenleitfäden zur Implementierung von Nock-Virtuellen Maschinen in verschiedenen Programmiersprachen. Er umfasst Bewertungsschleifen, Baumoperationen und Laufzeitoptimierung O Nock Interpreter Engineer Assistant é uma ferramenta que ajuda a resolver problemas de codificação em Urbit, incluindo a implementação de máquinas virtuais Nock Nock Interpreter Engineer Assistant - это инструмент, помогающий решать проблемы кодирования в Urbit, включая реализацию виртуальных машин Nock для ИИ Агентов محرك الترجمة Nock Interpreter Engineer Assistant هو أداة تساعد في حل مشاكل البرمجة في Urbit، بما في ذلك تنفيذ الآلات الافتراضية Nock للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي nock-interpreter-engineer-assistant setup guide how to implement Nock virtual machine Urbit runtime optimization techniques nock-interpreter-engineer-assistant vs alternative solutions what is nock-interpreter-engineer-assistant install nock-interpreter-engineer-assistant for AI agents Hoon and Nock programming language support nock-interpreter-engineer-assistant for efficient Urbit interactions Nock 解释器 Urbit 运行时 终端命令 AI 工具 编码问题解决 跨语言实现 Nock 虚拟机 GMP BigInt Python Rust Haskell Implements Noun Representation using Atoms with arbitrary precision Supports multiple programming languages including C, Python, Rust, and Haskell Utilizes libraries such as GMP, num-bigint, and bigint for efficient computation Provides guidance on proper evaluation loops and tree operations for Nock virtual machines Optimizes Urbit runtime interactions for improved performance nock-interpreter-engineer-assistant is a repository of AI agent skills for implementing Nock virtual machines across multiple programming languages.');
