vas para inspecciones de redes","fr":"Outils IA: json-canvas pour inspections de réseaux","de":"KI-Tools: json-canvas für Netzwerkinspektionen","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: json-canvas para Inspetção de Redes","ru":"ИИ Агенты: json-canvas для Утилитарных Сетевых Осмотров","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: json-canvas لتفقد الشبكات المرورية","en":"json-canvas"},"description":{"zh":"JSON Canvas是一个Obsidian插件，用于实用网络检查，利用Obsidian作为数据库、前端和数据同步工具。","ja":"JSON CanvasはObsidianプラグインであり、ユーティリティネットワークの検査に使用され、Obsidianをデータベース、フロントエンド、データ同期ツールとして利用します。","ko":"JSON Canvas는 유틸리티 네트워크 검사를 위해 Obsidian 플러그인으로 구축되었으며 Obsidian을 데이터베이스, 프론트엔드, 데이터 동기화 도구로 사용합니다.","es":"json-canvas es un plugin de Obsidian para inspecciones de redes de utilidad, que utiliza Obsidian como base de datos y sincronización de datos","fr":"json-canvas est un plugin Obsidian pour les inspections de réseaux d''utilité, qui utilise Obsidian comme base de données et synchronisation de données","de":"json-canvas ist ein Obsidian-Plugin für Netzwerkinspektionen, das Obsidian als Datenbank und Datensynchronisation verwendet","pt":"O json-canvas é um plugin do Obsidian para inspeções de redes de utilidades, utilizando Obsidian como banco de dados, frontend e veículo de sincronização de ...","ru":"Json-canvas - плагин Obsidian для осмотров утилитарных сетей, использующий Obsidian как базу данных, frontend и средство синхронизации данных","ar":"json-canvas هو إضافة Obsidian لتفقد الشبكات المرورية، يستخدم Obsidian كقاعدة بيانات وواجهة مستخدم وعربة مزامنة البيانات","en":"An Obsidian plugin built for utility network inspections, utilizing Obsidian as the database, frontend, and data sync vehicle."},"definition":{"en":"An Obsidian plugin built for utility network inspections, utilizing Obsidian as the database, frontend, and data sync vehicle."},"features":{"zh":["实用网络检查","Obsidian数据库集成","前端和数据同步","可扩展的插件架构","易于使用的界面"],"ja":["ユーティリティネットワークの検査","Obsidianデータベース統合","フロントエンドとデータ同期","拡張可能なプラグインアーキテクチャ","使いやすいインターフェース"],"ko":["유틸리티 네트워크 검사","Obsidian 데이터베이스 통합","프론트엔드와 데이터 동기화","확장 가능한 플러그인 아키텍처","사용하기 쉬운 인터페이스"],"es":["Plugin de Obsidian para inspecciones de redes","Utiliza Obsidian como base de datos","Sincronización de datos","Inspecciones de redes de utilidad","Desarrollado con tecnologías web"],"fr":["Plugin Obsidian pour les inspections de réseaux","Utilise Obsidian comme base de données","Synchronisation de données","Inspections de réseaux d''utilité","Développé avec des technologies web"],"de":["Obsidian-Plugin für Netzwerkinspektionen","Verwendet Obsidian als Datenbank","Datensynchronisation","Netzwerkinspektionen","Entwickelt mit Webtechnologien"],"pt":["Utiliza Obsidian como banco de dados","Sincronização de dados em tempo real","Frontend personalizável","Inspeções de redes de utilidades eficientes","Integração com outros plugins do Obsidian"],"ru":["Использует Obsidian как базу данных","Синхронизация данных в реальном времени","Пользовательский frontend","Эффективные осмотры утилитарных сетей","Интеграция с другими плагинами Obsidian"],"ar":["يستخدم Obsidian كقاعدة بيانات","مزامنة البيانات في الوقت الفعلي","واجهة مستخدم مخصصة","تفقد كفء للشبكات المرورية","التكامل مع إضافات Obsidian الأخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用JSON Canvas","什么是Obsidian插件","JSON Canvas替代品","Obsidian vs 其他数据库","JSON Canvas安装","JSON Canvas设置指南","实用网络检查工具"],"ja":["JSON Canvasの使い方","Obsidianプラグインとは","JSON Canvasの代替","Obsidian vs 他のデータベース","JSON Canvasのインストール","JSON Canvasの設定ガイド","ユーティリティネットワーク検査ツール"],"ko":["JSON Canvas 사용법","Obsidian 플러그인이란","JSON Canvas 대안","Obsidian vs 다른 데이터베이스","JSON Canvas 설치","JSON Canvas 설정 가이드","유틸리티 네트워크 검사 도구"],"es":["herramientas de AI para inspecciones de redes","json-canvas tutorial","cómo usar json-canvas","alternativas a json-canvas","json-canvas vs otros plugins","instalación de json-canvas","guía de configuración de json-canvas"],"fr":["outils IA pour les inspections de réseaux","tutoriel json-canvas","comment utiliser json-canvas","alternatives à json-canvas","json-canvas vs autres plugins","installation de json-canvas","guide de configuration de json-canvas"],"de":["KI-Tools für Netzwerkinspektionen","json-canvas-Tutorial","wie man json-canvas verwendet","Alternativen zu json-canvas","json-canvas vs andere Plugins","Installation von json-canvas","Konfigurationsanleitung für json-canvas"],"pt":["como usar json-canvas","o que é json-canvas","json-canvas alternativa","json-canvas vs outros plugins","instalar json-canvas","guia de configuração do json-canvas","desenvolvimento de plugins do Obsidian","ferramentas de IA para inspeções de redes"],"ru":["как использовать json-canvas","что такое json-canvas","json-canvas альтернатива","json-canvas vs другие плагины","установить json-canvas","руководство по настройке json-canvas","разработка плагинов Obsidian","ИИ инструменты для осмотров утилитарных сетей"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام json-canvas","ما هو json-canvas","بديل json-canvas","json-canvas مقابل إضافات أخرى","تثبيت json-canvas","دليل إعداد json-canvas","تطوير إضافات Obsidian","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتفقد الشبكات المرورية"]}},"owner":"rmachado24","repo":"obsidian-inspections","repoPath":"rmachado24/obsidian-inspections","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-03T01:58:23.337Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"json-canvas","description":"Create and edit JSON Canvas files (.canvas) with nodes, edges, groups, and connections. Use when working with .canvas files, creating visual canvases, mind maps, flowcharts, or when the user mentions Canvas files in Obsidian.","bodyPreview":"# JSON Canvas Skill\n\n## File Structure\n\nA canvas file (`.canvas`) contains two top-level arrays following the [JSON Canvas Spec 1.0](https://jsoncanvas.org/spec/1.0/):\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [],\n  \"edges\": []\n}\n```\n\n- `nodes` (optional): Array of node objects\n- `edges` (optional): Array of edge objects connecting nodes\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### 1. Create a New Canvas\n\n1. Create a `.canvas` file with the base structure `{\"nodes\": [], \"edges\": []}`\n2. Generate unique 16-character hex IDs for each n","body":"# JSON Canvas Skill\n\n## File Structure\n\nA canvas file (`.canvas`) contains two top-level arrays following the [JSON Canvas Spec 1.0](https://jsoncanvas.org/spec/1.0/):\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [],\n  \"edges\": []\n}\n```\n\n- `nodes` (optional): Array of node objects\n- `edges` (optional): Array of edge objects connecting nodes\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### 1. Create a New Canvas\n\n1. Create a `.canvas` file with the base structure `{\"nodes\": [], \"edges\": []}`\n2. Generate unique 16-character hex IDs for each node (e.g., `\"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\"`)\n3. Add nodes with required fields: `id`, `type`, `x`, `y`, `width`, `height`\n4. Add edges referencing valid node IDs via `fromNode` and `toNode`\n5. **Validate**: Parse the JSON to confirm it is valid. Verify all `fromNode`/`toNode` values exist in the nodes array\n\n### 2. Add a Node to an Existing Canvas\n\n1. Read and parse the existing `.canvas` file\n2. Generate a unique ID that does not collide with existing node or edge IDs\n3. Choose position (`x`, `y`) that avoids overlapping existing nodes (leave 50-100px spacing)\n4. Append the new node object to the `nodes` array\n5. Optionally add edges connecting the new node to existing nodes\n6. **Validate**: Confirm all IDs are unique and all edge references resolve to existing nodes\n\n### 3. Connect Two Nodes\n\n1. Identify the source and target node IDs\n2. Generate a unique edge ID\n3. Set `fromNode` and `toNode` to the source and target IDs\n4. Optionally set `fromSide`/`toSide` (top, right, bottom, left) for anchor points\n5. Optionally set `label` for descriptive text on the edge\n6. Append the edge to the `edges` array\n7. **Validate**: Confirm both `fromNode` and `toNode` reference existing node IDs\n\n### 4. Edit an Existing Canvas\n\n1. Read and parse the `.canvas` file as JSON\n2. Locate the target node or edge by `id`\n3. Modify the desired attributes (text, position, color, etc.)\n4. Write the updated JSON back to the file\n5. **Validate**: Re-check all ID uniqueness and edge reference integrity after editing\n\n## Nodes\n\nNodes are objects placed on the canvas. Array order determines z-index: first node = bottom layer, last node = top layer.\n\n### Generic Node Attributes\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `id` | Yes | string | Unique 16-char hex identifier |\n| `type` | Yes | string | `text`, `file`, `link`, or `group` |\n| `x` | Yes | integer | X position in pixels |\n| `y` | Yes | integer | Y position in pixels |\n| `width` | Yes | integer | Width in pixels |\n| `height` | Yes | integer | Height in pixels |\n| `color` | No | canvasColor | Preset `\"1\"`-`\"6\"` or hex (e.g., `\"#FF0000\"`) |\n\n### Text Nodes\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `text` | Yes | string | Plain text with Markdown syntax |\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\",\n  \"type\": \"text\",\n  \"x\": 0,\n  \"y\": 0,\n  \"width\": 400,\n  \"height\": 200,\n  \"text\": \"# Hello World\\n\\nThis is **Markdown** content.\"\n}\n```\n\n**Newline pitfall**: Use `\\n` for line breaks in JSON strings. Do **not** use the literal `\\\\n` -- Obsidian renders that as the characters `\\` and `n`.\n\n### File Nodes\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `file` | Yes | string | Path to file within the system |\n| `subpath` | No | string | Link to heading or block (starts with `#`) |\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4e5f67890\",\n  \"type\": \"file\",\n  \"x\": 500,\n  \"y\": 0,\n  \"width\": 400,\n  \"height\": 300,\n  \"file\": \"Attachments/diagram.png\"\n}\n```\n\n### Link Nodes\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `url` | Yes | string | External URL |\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"c3d4e5f678901234\",\n  \"type\": \"link\",\n  \"x\": 1000,\n  \"y\": 0,\n  \"width\": 400,\n  \"height\": 200,\n  \"url\": \"https://obsidian.md\"\n}\n```\n\n### Group Nodes\n\nGroups are visual containers for organizing other nodes. Position child nodes inside the group''s bounds.\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `label` | No | string | Text label for the group |\n| `background` | No | string | Path to background image |\n| `backgroundStyle` | No | string | `cover`, `ratio`, or `repeat` |\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"d4e5f6789012345a\",\n  \"type\": \"group\",\n  \"x\": -50,\n  \"y\": -50,\n  \"width\": 1000,\n  \"height\": 600,\n  \"label\": \"Project Overview\",\n  \"color\": \"4\"\n}\n```\n\n## Edges\n\nEdges connect nodes via `fromNode` and `toNode` IDs.\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Default | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|---------|-------------|\n| `id` | Yes | string | - | Unique identifier |\n| `fromNode` | Yes | string | - | Source node ID |\n| `fromSide` | No | string | - | `top`, `right`, `bottom`, or `left` |\n| `fromEnd` | No | string | `none` | `none` or `arrow` |\n| `toNode` | Yes | string | - | Target node ID |\n| `toSide` | No | string | - | `top`, `right`, `bottom`, or `left` |\n| `toEnd` | No | string | `arrow` | `none` or `arrow` |\n| `color` | No | canvasColor | - | Line color |\n| `label` | No | string | - | Text label |\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"0123456789abcdef\",\n  \"fromNode\": \"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\",\n  \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n  \"toNode\": \"a1b2c3d4e5f67890\",\n  \"toSide\": \"left\",\n  \"toEnd\": \"arrow\",\n  \"label\": \"leads to\"\n}\n```\n\n## Colors\n\nThe `canvasColor` type accepts either a hex string or a preset number:\n\n| Preset | Color |\n|--------|-------|\n| `\"1\"` | Red |\n| `\"2\"` | Orange |\n| `\"3\"` | Yellow |\n| `\"4\"` | Green |\n| `\"5\"` | Cyan |\n| `\"6\"` | Purple |\n\nPreset color values are intentionally undefined -- applications use their own brand colors.\n\n## ID Generation\n\nGenerate 16-character lowercase hexadecimal strings (64-bit random value):\n\n```\n\"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\"\n\"a3b2c1d0e9f8a7b6\"\n```\n\n## Layout Guidelines\n\n- Coordinates can be negative (canvas extends infinitely)\n- `x` increases right, `y` increases down; position is the top-left corner\n- Space nodes 50-100px apart; leave 20-50px padding inside groups\n- Align to grid (multiples of 10 or 20) for cleaner layouts\n\n| Node Type | Suggested Width | Suggested Height |\n|-----------|-----------------|------------------|\n| Small text | 200-300 | 80-150 |\n| Medium text | 300-450 | 150-300 |\n| Large text | 400-600 | 300-500 |\n| File preview | 300-500 | 200-400 |\n| Link preview | 250-400 | 100-200 |\n\n## Validation Checklist\n\nAfter creating or editing a canvas file, verify:\n\n1. All `id` values are unique across both nodes and edges\n2. Every `fromNode` and `toNode` references an existing node ID\n3. Required fields are present for each node type (`text` for text nodes, `file` for file nodes, `url` for link nodes)\n4. `type` is one of: `text`, `file`, `link`, `group`\n5. `fromSide`/`toSide` values are one of: `top`, `right`, `bottom`, `left`\n6. `fromEnd`/`toEnd` values are one of: `none`, `arrow`\n7. Color presets are `\"1\"` through `\"6\"` or valid hex (e.g., `\"#FF0000\"`)\n8. JSON is valid and parseable\n\nIf validation fails, check for duplicate IDs, dangling edge references, or malformed JSON strings (especially unescaped newlines in text content).\n\n## Complete Examples\n\nSee [references/EXAMPLES.md](references/EXAMPLES.md) for full canvas examples including mind maps, project boards, research canvases, and flowcharts.\n\n## References\n\n- [JSON Canvas Spec 1.0](https://jsoncanvas.org/spec/1.0/)\n- [JSON Canvas GitHub](https://github.com/obsidianmd/jsoncanvas)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-03T02:56:01.923Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Graph-Based AI Agents needing advanced network visualization and inspection capabilities with JSON Canvas Spec 1.0 compatibility.","zh":"适合需要高级网络可视化和检查功能的基于图的AI代理，兼容JSON Canvas Spec 1.0。","ja":"グラフベースのAIエージェントが高度なネットワーク可視化および検査機能を必要とする場合に適しています。JSON Canvas Spec 1.0との互換性あり。","ko":"고급 네트워크 시각화 및 검사 기능과 JSON Canvas Spec 1.0 호환성을 필요로 하는 그래프 기반 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Inteligencia Artificial basados en Grafos que necesitan capacidades de visualización e inspección de redes avanzadas con compatibilidad con JSON Canvas Spec 1.0.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Intelligence Artificielle basés sur des Graphes nécessitant des capacités de visualisation et d''inspection de réseaux avancées avec une compatibilité avec JSON Canvas Spec 1.0.","de":"Perfekt für graphbasierte KI-Agents, die erweiterte Netzwerkvisualisierungs- und Inspektionsfunktionen mit JSON Canvas Spec 1.0-Kompatibilität benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Baseados em Grafos que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de visualização e inspeção de rede com compatibilidade com JSON Canvas Spec 1.0.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе графов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности визуализации и инспекции сетей с поддержкой JSON Canvas Spec 1.0.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المبني على الرسوم البيانية الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتصوير الشبكة وفتحها مع توافق JSON Canvas Spec 1.0."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage utility network inspections utilizing Obsidian as the database, frontend, and data sync vehicle, leveraging JSON Canvas files (.canvas) for node and edge management.","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理实用网络检查的能力，使用Obsidian作为数据库、前端和数据同步工具，并利用JSON Canvas文件（.canvas）进行节点和边管理。","ja":"エージェントがユーティリティネットワークの検査を作成および管理する機能を提供します。Obsidianをデータベース、フロントエンド、データ同期ツールとして使用し、ノードとエッジの管理にはJSON Canvasファイル（.canvas）を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 유틸리티 네트워크 검사를 생성하고 관리할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. Obsidian을 데이터베이스, 프론트엔드 및 데이터 동기화 도구로 사용하며 JSON Canvas 파일(.canvas)을 통해 노드와 에지 관리를 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y gestionar inspecciones de redes de servicios utilizando Obsidian como base de datos, interfaz de usuario y vehículo de sincronización de datos, aprovechando archivos JSON Canvas (.canvas) para la gestión de nodos y aristas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des inspections de réseaux de services en utilisant Obsidian comme base de données, interface utilisateur et véhicule de synchronisation de données, en exploitant les fichiers JSON Canvas (.canvas) pour la gestion des nœuds et des arêtes.","de":"Ermöglich es den Agents, Utility-Netzwerkinspektionen zu erstellen und zu verwalten, indem Obsidian als Datenbank, Benutzeroberfläche und Daten-Sync-Fahrzeug verwendet wird, wobei JSON Canvas-Dateien (.canvas) für die Verwaltung von Knoten und Kanten genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e gerenciar inspeções de redes de utilidade, utilizando Obsidian como banco de dados, frontend e veículo de sincronização de dados, aproveitando arquivos JSON Canvas (.canvas) para gerenciamento de nó e aresta.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать и управлять утилитарными сетевыми инспекциями, используя Obsidian в качестве базы данных, frontend и транспортного средства для синхронизации данных, используя файлы JSON Canvas (.canvas) для управления узлами и ребрами.","ar":"يُمكّن العميل من إنشاء وإدارة عمليات تفتيش للشبكات المرتبطة بالمرافق، باستخدام Obsidian كقاعدة بيانات وواجهة مستخدم ووسيلة لنقل البيانات، مع الاستفادة من ملفات JSON Canvas (.canvas) لإدارة العقد والهياكل."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new canvas files with base structure for network inspections","Generating unique 16-character hex IDs for nodes and edges","Inspecting and analyzing network topologies with nodes and edges"],"zh":["创建具有基础结构的新画布文件以进行网络检查","为节点和边生成唯一的16字符十六进制ID","使用节点和边检查和分析网络拓扑"],"ja":["ネットワーク検査用の基本構造を持つ新しいキャンバスファイルを作成する","ノードとエッジに一意の16文字の16進数IDを生成する","ノードとエッジを使用してネットワークトポロジーを検査および分析する"],"ko":["네트워크 검사를 위한 기본 구조를 갖춘 새로운 캔버스 파일을 생성하는 것","노드와 에지에 고유한 16자리 16진수 ID를 생성하는 것","노드와 에지를 사용하여 네트워크 토폴로지를 검사하고 분석하는 것"],"es":["Crear nuevos archivos de lienzo con estructura base para inspecciones de redes","Generar IDs de hexadecimales únicos de 16 caracteres para nodos y aristas","Inspeccionar y analizar topologías de redes con nodos y aristas"],"fr":["Créer de nouveaux fichiers de canevas avec une structure de base pour les inspections de réseaux","Générer des IDs hexadécimaux uniques de 16 caractères pour les nœuds et les arêtes","Inspecter et analyser les topologies de réseaux avec des nœuds et des arêtes"],"de":["Erstellen neuer Canvas-Dateien mit Basisstruktur für Netzwerkinspektionen","Generieren eindeutiger 16-stelliger Hex-IDs für Knoten und Kanten","Untersuchen und analysieren von Netzwerktopologien mit Knoten und Kanten"],"pt":["Criar novos arquivos de canvas com estrutura base para inspeções de rede","Gerar IDs hexadecimais únicos de 16 caracteres para nós e arestas","Inspecionar e analisar topologias de rede com nós e arestas"],"ru":["Создание новых файлов холста с базовой структурой для сетевых инспекций","Генерация уникальных 16-символьных шестнадцатеричных идентификаторов для узлов и ребер","Осмотр и анализ сетевых топологий с узлами и ребрами"],"ar":["إنشاء ملفات新的 من Canvas مع هيكل أساسي لعمليات تفتيش الشبكة","توليد معرّفات سداسية فريدة من نوعها تبلغ 16 حرفًا للعقد والهياكل","فحص وتحليل طوبولوجيا الشبكة مع العقد والهياكل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Obsidian plugin installation","Limited to JSON Canvas Spec 1.0 compatibility","Dependent on Obsidian for database, frontend, and data sync functionality"],"zh":["需要安装Obsidian插件","仅限于JSON Canvas Spec 1.0的兼容性","依赖于Obsidian进行数据库、前端和数据同步功能"],"ja":["Obsidianプラグインのインストールが必要","JSON Canvas Spec 1.0との互換性に限られる","データベース、フロントエンド、データ同期機能にObsidianに依存する"],"ko":["Obsidian 플러그인 설치가 필요함","JSON Canvas Spec 1.0과의 호환성에만 제한됨","데이터베이스, 프론트엔드, 데이터 동기화 기능에 Obsidian에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere la instalación del plugin Obsidian","Limitado a la compatibilidad con JSON Canvas Spec 1.0","Dependiente de Obsidian para la funcionalidad de base de datos, interfaz de usuario y sincronización de datos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation du plugin Obsidian","Limité à la compatibilité avec JSON Canvas Spec 1.0","Dépendant d''Obsidian pour la fonctionnalité de base de données, interface utilisateur et synchronisation de données"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation des Obsidian-Plugins","Begrenzt auf die Kompatibilität mit JSON Canvas Spec 1.0","Abhängig von Obsidian für die Datenbank-, Benutzeroberflächen- und Daten-Sync-Funktionalität"],"pt":["Requer instalação do plugin do Obsidian","Limitado à compatibilidade com JSON Canvas Spec 1.0","Dependente do Obsidian para funcionalidade de banco de dados, frontend e sincronização de dados"],"ru":["Требуется установка плагина Obsidian","Ограничен совместимостью с JSON Canvas Spec 1.0","Зависит от Obsidian для функциональности базы данных, frontend и синхронизации данных"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت إضافة Obsidian","محدود بالتوافق مع JSON Canvas Spec 1.0","يعتمد على Obsidian لوظيفة قاعدة البيانات وواجهة المستخدم ونقل البيانات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"97d1ae0728955c4203922753d5656890e5e4dd371b8306ea11884f9b510f1b85","qualityScore":33}');
