Environments\n\nImplement GitHub and Microsoft OAuth in Cloudflare Workers and other edge runtimes.\n\n## GitHub OAuth\n\n### Required Headers\n\nGitHub API has strict requirements that differ from other providers.\n\n| Header | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `User-Agent` | **REQUIRED** - Returns 403 without it |\n| `Accept` | `application/vnd.github+json` recommended |\n\n```typescript\nconst resp = await fetch(''https://api.github.com/user'', {\n  headers: {\n    Authoriz","body":"# OAuth Integrations for Edge Environments\n\nImplement GitHub and Microsoft OAuth in Cloudflare Workers and other edge runtimes.\n\n## GitHub OAuth\n\n### Required Headers\n\nGitHub API has strict requirements that differ from other providers.\n\n| Header | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `User-Agent` | **REQUIRED** - Returns 403 without it |\n| `Accept` | `application/vnd.github+json` recommended |\n\n```typescript\nconst resp = await fetch(''https://api.github.com/user'', {\n  headers: {\n    Authorization: `Bearer ${accessToken}`,\n    ''User-Agent'': ''MyApp/1.0'',  // Required!\n    ''Accept'': ''application/vnd.github+json'',\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Private Email Handling\n\nGitHub users can set email to private (`/user` returns `email: null`).\n\n```typescript\nif (!userData.email) {\n  const emails = await fetch(''https://api.github.com/user/emails'', { headers })\n    .then(r => r.json());\n  userData.email = emails.find(e => e.primary && e.verified)?.email;\n}\n```\n\nRequires `user:email` scope.\n\n### Token Exchange\n\nToken exchange returns form-encoded by default. Add Accept header for JSON:\n\n```typescript\nconst tokenResponse = await fetch(''https://github.com/login/oauth/access_token'', {\n  method: ''POST'',\n  headers: {\n    ''Content-Type'': ''application/x-www-form-urlencoded'',\n    ''Accept'': ''application/json'',  // Get JSON response\n  },\n  body: new URLSearchParams({ code, client_id, client_secret, redirect_uri }),\n});\n```\n\n### GitHub OAuth Notes\n\n| Issue | Solution |\n|-------|----------|\n| Callback URL | Must be EXACT - no wildcards, no subdirectory matching |\n| Token exchange returns form-encoded | Add `''Accept'': ''application/json''` header |\n| Tokens don''t expire | No refresh flow needed, but revoked = full re-auth |\n\n## Microsoft Entra (Azure AD) OAuth\n\n### Why MSAL Doesn''t Work in Workers\n\nMSAL.js depends on:\n- Browser APIs (localStorage, sessionStorage, DOM)\n- Node.js crypto module\n\nCloudflare''s V8 isolate runtime has neither. Use manual OAuth instead:\n1. Manual OAuth URL construction\n2. Direct token exchange via fetch\n3. JWT validation with `jose` library\n\n### Required Scopes\n\n```typescript\n// For user identity (email, name, profile picture)\nconst scope = ''openid email profile User.Read'';\n\n// For refresh tokens (long-lived sessions)\nconst scope = ''openid email profile User.Read offline_access'';\n```\n\n**Critical**: `User.Read` is required for Microsoft Graph `/me` endpoint. Without it, token exchange succeeds but user info fetch returns 403.\n\n### User Info Endpoint\n\n```typescript\n// Microsoft Graph /me endpoint\nconst resp = await fetch(''https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/me'', {\n  headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${accessToken}` },\n});\n\n// Email may be in different fields\nconst email = data.mail || data.userPrincipalName;\n```\n\n### Tenant Configuration\n\n| Tenant Value | Who Can Sign In |\n|--------------|-----------------|\n| `common` | Any Microsoft account (personal + work) |\n| `organizations` | Work/school accounts only |\n| `consumers` | Personal Microsoft accounts only |\n| `{tenant-id}` | Specific organization only |\n\n### Azure Portal Setup\n\n1. App Registration → New registration\n2. Platform: **Web** (not SPA) for server-side OAuth\n3. Redirect URIs: Add both `/callback` and `/admin/callback`\n4. Certificates & secrets → New client secret\n\n### Token Lifetimes\n\n| Token Type | Default Lifetime | Notes |\n|------------|------------------|-------|\n| Access token | 60-90 minutes | Configurable via token lifetime policies |\n| Refresh token | 90 days | Revoked on password change |\n| ID token | 60 minutes | Same as access token |\n\n**Best Practice**: Always request `offline_access` scope and implement refresh token flow for sessions longer than 1 hour.\n\n## Common Corrections\n\n| If Claude suggests... | Use instead... |\n|----------------------|----------------|\n| GitHub fetch without User-Agent | Add `''User-Agent'': ''AppName/1.0''` (REQUIRED) |\n| Using MSAL.js in Workers | Manual OAuth + jose for JWT validation |\n| Microsoft scope without User.Read | Add `User.Read` scope |\n| Fetching email from token claims only | Use Graph `/me` endpoint |\n\n## Error Reference\n\n### GitHub Errors\n\n| Error | Cause | Fix |\n|-------|-------|-----|\n| 403 Forbidden | Missing User-Agent header | Add User-Agent header |\n| `email: null` | User has private email | Fetch `/user/emails` with `user:email` scope |\n\n### Microsoft Errors\n\n| Error | Cause | Fix |\n|-------|-------|-----|\n| AADSTS50058 | Silent auth failed | Use interactive flow |\n| AADSTS700084 | Refresh token expired | Re-authenticate user |\n| 403 on Graph /me | Missing User.Read scope | Add User.Read to scopes |\n\n## Reference\n\n- GitHub API: https://docs.github.com/en/rest\n- GitHub OAuth: https://docs.github.com/en/apps/oauth-apps\n- Microsoft Graph permissions: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/permissions-reference\n- AADSTS error codes: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/identity-platform/reference-error-codes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-05T08:14:36.270Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Edge Environment Agents requiring seamless GitHub and Microsoft OAuth integrations.","zh":"适用于需要无缝集成GitHub和Microsoft OAuth的边缘环境代理。","ja":"GitHubおよびMicrosoft OAuthとのシームレスな統合を必要とするエッジ環境エージェントに適しています。","ko":"GitHub 및 Microsoft OAuth와의 무결점 통합을 필요로 하는 에지 환경 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Entorno de Edge que requieren integraciones de GitHub y Microsoft OAuth sin problemas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''environnement Edge nécessitant des intégrations GitHub et Microsoft OAuth sans interruption.","de":"Ideal für Edge-Umgebung-Agenten, die eine nahtlose Integration von GitHub und Microsoft OAuth erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Ambiente de Borda que exigem integrações GitHub e Microsoft OAuth sem interrupções.","ru":"Идеально для агентов среды Edge, требующих бесшовной интеграции GitHub и Microsoft OAuth.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء في بيئة الحوافز التي تتطلب تكاملات GitHub و Microsoft OAuth دون انقطاع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to authenticate with GitHub and Microsoft using OAuth protocols, enabling secure data exchange and leveraging libraries like Cloudflare Workers for edge runtime deployments, while adhering to strict requirements such as the `User-Agent` and `Accept` headers for GitHub API interactions.","zh":"赋予代理使用OAuth协议与GitHub和Microsoft进行身份验证的能力，实现安全的数据交换，并利用Cloudflare Workers等库进行边缘运行时部署，同时遵守严格的要求，例如GitHub API交互中的`User-Agent`和`Accept`头。","ja":"GitHubおよびMicrosoftとOAuthプロトコルを使用して認証するエージェントを有効にし、セキュアなデータ交換を可能にし、Cloudflare Workersなどのライブラリを使用してエッジランタイムのデプロイを容易にし、GitHub APIの相互作用における`User-Agent`および`Accept`ヘッダーなどの厳格な要件に従うことができます。","ko":"에이전트가 OAuth 프로토콜을 사용하여 GitHub 및 Microsoft와 인증할 수 있도록 하여 안전한 데이터 교환을 가능하게 하고 Cloudflare Workers와 같은 라이브러리를 사용하여 에지 런타임 배포를 용이하게 하며 GitHub API 상호 작용의 `User-Agent` 및 `Accept` 헤더와 같은 엄격한 요구 사항을 준수합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para autenticarse con GitHub y Microsoft utilizando protocolos OAuth, lo que permite un intercambio de datos seguro y aprovecha bibliotecas como Cloudflare Workers para implementaciones de tiempo de ejecución de edge, mientras se adhieren a los requisitos estrictos como los encabezados `User-Agent` y `Accept` para las interacciones de la API de GitHub.","fr":"Permet aux agents de s''authentifier auprès de GitHub et de Microsoft en utilisant les protocoles OAuth, ce qui permet un échange de données sécurisé et utilise des bibliothèques comme Cloudflare Workers pour les déploiements d''exécution de edge, tout en respectant les exigences strictes telles que les en-têtes `User-Agent` et `Accept` pour les interactions de l''API GitHub.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, sich bei GitHub und Microsoft mithilfe von OAuth-Protokollen zu authentifizieren, wodurch ein sicherer Datenaustausch ermöglicht wird und Bibliotheken wie Cloudflare Workers für Edge-Laufzeitbereitstellungen genutzt werden, während sich an strenge Anforderungen wie die `User-Agent`- und `Accept`-Header für GitHub-API-Interaktionen gehalten wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a autenticar com GitHub e Microsoft usando protocolos OAuth, permitindo troca de dados segura e aproveitando bibliotecas como Cloudflare Workers para implantações de tempo de execução de borda, enquanto atende a requisitos rigorosos, como os cabeçalhos `User-Agent` e `Accept` para interações da API do GitHub.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью аутентификации с GitHub и Microsoft с использованием протоколов OAuth, обеспечивая безопасный обмен данными и используя библиотеки, такие как Cloudflare Workers, для развертывания среды выполнения Edge, а также соблюдая строгие требования, такие как заголовки `User-Agent` и `Accept` для взаимодействия с API GitHub.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على المصادقة على GitHub و Microsoft باستخدام بروتوكولات OAuth، مما يتيح تبادل البيانات الأمنية وتحقيق المكتبات مثل Cloudflare Workers لتنفيذ وقت التشغيل الحوافي، مع الامتثال للمتطلبات الصارمة مثل رؤوس `User-Agent` و `Accept` للتفاعلات مع API GitHub."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing GitHub OAuth for secure repository access","Authenticating Microsoft services using OAuth in edge environments","Developing Cloudflare Workers with integrated OAuth functionality"],"zh":["实现GitHub OAuth以实现安全的存储库访问","在边缘环境中使用OAuth对Microsoft服务进行身份验证","开发集成了OAuth功能的Cloudflare Workers"],"ja":["セキュアなリポジトリアクセスを実現するためにGitHub OAuthを実装する","エッジ環境でOAuthを使用してMicrosoftサービスを認証する","OAuth機能を統合したCloudflare Workersを開発する"],"ko":["보안 저장소 액세스를实现하기 위해 GitHub OAuth 구현","에지 환경에서 OAuth를 사용하여 Microsoft 서비스를 인증","OAuth 기능을 통합한 Cloudflare Workers 개발"],"es":["Implementar GitHub OAuth para el acceso seguro al repositorio","Autenticar servicios de Microsoft mediante OAuth en entornos de edge","Desarrollar Cloudflare Workers con funcionalidad OAuth integrada"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre GitHub OAuth pour un accès sécurisé au référentiel","Authentifier les services Microsoft à l''aide d''OAuth dans les environnements de edge","Développer Cloudflare Workers avec une fonctionnalité OAuth intégrée"],"de":["Implementierung von GitHub OAuth für den sicheren Zugriff auf das Repository","Authentifizierung von Microsoft-Diensten mithilfe von OAuth in Edge-Umgebungen","Entwicklung von Cloudflare Workers mit integrierter OAuth-Funktionalität"],"pt":["Implementação do GitHub OAuth para acesso seguro ao repositório","Autenticação de serviços Microsoft usando OAuth em ambientes de borda","Desenvolvimento de Cloudflare Workers com funcionalidade OAuth integrada"],"ru":["Реализация GitHub OAuth для безопасного доступа к репозиторию","Аутентификация сервисов Microsoft с использованием OAuth в среде Edge","Разработка Cloudflare Workers с интегрированной функциональностью OAuth"],"ar":["تنفيذ GitHub OAuth للوصول الآمن إلى المستودع","المصادقة على خدمات Microsoft باستخدام OAuth في بيئات الحوافز","تطوير Cloudflare Workers مع وظائف OAuth المدمجة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specific headers for GitHub API requests, such as `User-Agent` and `Accept`","Limited to GitHub and Microsoft OAuth implementations","Dependent on Cloudflare Workers or similar edge runtimes for deployment"],"zh":["需要特定的头部信息，例如`User-Agent`和`Accept`，用于GitHub API请求","仅限于GitHub和Microsoft OAuth实现","依赖于Cloudflare Workers或类似的边缘运行时进行部署"],"ja":["GitHub APIリクエストに`User-Agent`および`Accept`などの特定のヘッダーが必要","GitHubおよびMicrosoft OAuthの実装のみに限定される","デプロイにはCloudflare Workersまたは同等のエッジランタイムに依存する"],"ko":["GitHub API 요청에 `User-Agent` 및 `Accept` 헤더와 같은 특정 헤더가 필요","GitHub 및 Microsoft OAuth 구현에만限定","배포에는 Cloudflare Workers 또는 유사한 에지 런타임에 의존"],"es":["Requiere encabezados específicos para las solicitudes de la API de GitHub, como `User-Agent` y `Accept`","Limitado a implementaciones de GitHub y Microsoft OAuth","Dependiente de Cloudflare Workers o entornos de ejecución de edge similares para la implementación"],"fr":["Nécessite des en-têtes spécifiques pour les requêtes d''API GitHub, tels que `User-Agent` et `Accept`","Limité aux implémentations OAuth de GitHub et Microsoft","Dépendant de Cloudflare Workers ou de runtime de edge similaires pour le déploiement"],"de":["Erfordert spezifische Header für GitHub-API-Anfragen, wie `User-Agent` und `Accept`","Begrenzt auf GitHub- und Microsoft-OAuth-Implementierungen","Abhängig von Cloudflare Workers oder ähnlichen Edge-Laufzeitumgebungen für die Bereitstellung"],"pt":["Exige cabeçalhos específicos para solicitações da API do GitHub, como `User-Agent` e `Accept`","Limitado às implementações de GitHub e Microsoft OAuth","Dependente de Cloudflare Workers ou tempos de execução de borda semelhantes para implantação"],"ru":["Требует конкретных заголовков для запросов API GitHub, таких как `User-Agent` и `Accept`","Ограничен реализациями GitHub и Microsoft OAuth","Зависит от Cloudflare Workers или аналогичных сред выполнения Edge для развертывания"],"ar":["يتطلب رؤوسا محددة لطلبات API GitHub، مثل `User-Agent` و `Accept`","محدود بالتنفيذات التي تدعم GitHub و Microsoft OAuth","يعتمد على Cloudflare Workers أو أوقات تشغيل الحوافز المماثلة للنشر"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"75affa91dcec597c0b04ac93e5d3f91aa4ff91a3e266deacc2d61f8e537021fa","qualityScore":33}');
