 Trending 数据抓取和集成指南","ja":"GitHub Trending API 代替方案 - AIエージェントのベストプラクティス","ko":"GitHub Trending 데이터 가져오기 및 활용 방법","es":"Guía de configuración de github-trending para desarrollad...","fr":"Guide de mise en place de github-trending pour les dévelo...","de":"Einrichtungsleitfaden für github-trending für Entwickler","pt":"Guia de Configuração do github-trending para Desenvolvedores","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Настройка github-trending для Разработчиков","ar":"إعداد github-trending للطورين: دليل شامل"},"description":{"en":"Unlock GitHub''s hidden gems with github-trending! Discover how to fetch trending repositories and developers using web scraping or GitHub Search API - get st...","zh":"了解如何使用 GitHub Trending Skill 获取热门仓库和开发者数据，包括 Web Scraping 和 GitHub Search API","ja":"GitHub Trending Skill を使用して、人気のリポジトリと開発者を検索し、データを取得する方法を学びます","ko":"GitHub Trending Skill을 사용하여 인기 있는 저장소와 개발자 데이터를 가져와 활용하는 방법을 알아보세요","es":"Aprende a utilizar github-trending con web scraping o GitHub Search API para fetching de repositorios y desarrolladores","fr":"Découvrez comment utiliser github-trending avec le web scraping ou l''API de recherche GitHub pour récupérer des repositories et des développeurs","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie github-trending mit Web Scraping oder der GitHub Search API verwenden, um Repositories und Entwickler abzurufen","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o github-trending para fetchar repositórios e desenvolvedores em tendência no GitHub usando web scraping ou GitHub Search API","ru":"Узнайте, как настроить github-trending для получения данных о трендах репозиториев и разработчиков на GitHub с помощью web scraping или GitHub Search API","ar":"تعلم كيفية تكوين github-trending لجلب البيانات حول المستودعات والمنشئين الشائعين على GitHub باستخدام تقنيات الويب سكرابينج أو GitHub Search API"},"definition":{"en":"github-trending is a skill that uses web scraping or GitHub Search API to fetch trending repositories and developers from GitHub.","zh":"GitHub Trending Skill 是一种使用 Web Scraping 或 GitHub Search API 获取热门仓库和开发者数据的技术","ja":"GitHub Trending Skill は、人気のリポジトリと開発者データを取得するために、Web Scraping または GitHub Search API を使用する AIエージェントの機能です","ko":"GitHub Trending Skill은 인기 있는 저장소와 개발자 데이터를 가져오는 데 사용되는 Web Scraping 또는 GitHub Search API 기술입니다","es":"github-trending es una habilidad que utiliza web scraping o GitHub Search API para fetch de datos de tendencias de GitHub","fr":"github-trending est une compétence qui utilise le web scraping ou l''API de recherche GitHub pour récupérer des données de tendances GitHub","de":"github-trending ist eine Fähigkeit, die Web Scraping oder die GitHub Search API verwendet, um GitHub-Trend-Daten abzurufen","pt":"github-trending é uma habilidade que fornece dados sobre repositórios e desenvolvedores em tendência no GitHub","ru":"github-trending - это навык, который предоставляет данные о трендах репозиториев и разработчиков на GitHub","ar":"github-trending هو مهارة يُقدم بيانات حول المستودعات والمنشئين الشائعين على GitHub"},"features":{"en":["Uses web scraping as a recommended method for fetching trending data","Utilizes GitHub Search API as an alternative for fetching trending repositories","Supports TypeScript for defining trending repository interfaces","Extracts repository information including owner, name, URL, description, language, stars, forks, and today''s stars"," Employs Cheerio for HTML parsing and data extraction","Provides an async function for fetching trending data"],"zh":["支持 Web Scraping 和 GitHub Search API","获取热门仓库和开发者数据","使用 TypeScript 和 Cheerio 库","提供 TrendingRepo 接口","支持异步数据获取"],"ja":["Web Scraping と GitHub Search API をサポート","人気のリポジトリと開発者データを取得","TypeScript と Cheerio ライブラリを使用","TrendingRepo インターフェイスを提供","非同期データ取得をサポート"],"ko":["Web Scraping과 GitHub Search API를 지원","인기 있는 저장소와 개발자 데이터를 가져옴","TypeScript와 Cheerio 라이브러리를 사용","TrendingRepo 인터페이스를 제공","비동기 데이터 가져오기를 지원"],"es":["Utiliza web scraping para fetch de datos de tendencias de GitHub","Soporta GitHub Search API como alternativa","Permite a los desarrolladores fetch de repositorios y desarrolladores","Incluye una interfaz de programación de aplicaciones (API) para el acceso a los datos","Utiliza TypeScript para el desarrollo de la habilidad"],"fr":["Utilise le web scraping pour récupérer des données de tendances GitHub","Prend en charge l''API de recherche GitHub comme alternative","Permet aux développeurs de récupérer des repositories et des développeurs","Inclut une interface de programmation d''applications (API) pour accéder aux données","Utilise TypeScript pour le développement de la compétence"],"de":["Verwendet Web Scraping, um GitHub-Trend-Daten abzurufen","Unterstützt die GitHub Search API als Alternative","Ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Repositories und Entwickler abzurufen","Enthält eine Programmierschnittstelle (API) für den Zugriff auf die Daten","Verwendet TypeScript für die Entwicklung der Fähigkeit"],"pt":["Uso de web scraping para fetchar dados de repositórios em tendência","Suporte à GitHub Search API para busca de repositórios e desenvolvedores","Interface de programação TypeScript para desenvolvedores","Tipos de dados personalizados para repositórios em tendência","Suporte à extração de dados de estrelas, bifurcações e linguagens de programação"],"ru":["Использование web scraping для сбора данных о трендах репозиториев","Поддержка GitHub Search API для поиска репозиториев и разработчиков","Интерфейс программирования TypeScript для разработчиков","Пользовательские типы данных для трендов репозиториев","Поддержка извлечения данных о звездах, вилках и языках программирования"],"ar":["استخدام تقنيات الويب سكرابينج لجلب بيانات حول المستودعات الشائعة","دعم GitHub Search API للبحث عن المستودعات والمنشئين","واجهة برمجة TypeScript للطورين","أنواع بيانات مخصصة للمستودعات الشائعة","دعم استخراج البيانات حول النجوم والفرع واللغات البرمجية"]},"keywords":{"en":["github-trending setup guide","how to use github-trending","github-trending alternative","github-trending vs github api","github-trending install","what is github-trending","github-trending web scraping","github-trending search api","github trending repositories","github trending developers"],"zh":["GitHub Trending","Web Scraping","GitHub Search API","TypeScript","Cheerio","TrendingRepo","AIエージェント","数据抓取","仓库数据"],"ja":["GitHub Trending","Web Scraping","GitHub Search API","TypeScript","Cheerio","TrendingRepo","AIエージェント","データ取得","リポジトリデータ"],"ko":["GitHub Trending","Web Scraping","GitHub Search API","TypeScript","Cheerio","TrendingRepo","AI에이전트","데이터 가져오기","저장소 데이터"],"es":["github-trending","web scraping","GitHub Search API","desarrollo de habilidades","fetch de datos","repositorios de GitHub","desarrolladores de GitHub","TypeScript","API de programación de aplicaciones"],"fr":["github-trending","web scraping","API de recherche GitHub","développement de compétences","récupération de données","repositories GitHub","développeurs GitHub","TypeScript","interface de programmation d''applications"],"de":["github-trending","Web Scraping","GitHub Search API","Fähigkeitsentwicklung","Datenabruf","GitHub-Repositories","GitHub-Entwickler","TypeScript","Programmierschnittstelle"],"pt":["github trending","web scraping github","github search api","typescript github","repositórios em tendência","desenvolvedores github","git hub api","github desenvolvedores"],"ru":["github trending","веб скреппинг github","github search api","typescript github","тренды репозиториев","разработчики github","git hub api","github разработчики"],"ar":["github trending","ويب سكرابينج github","github search api","typescript github","مستودعات شائعة","منشئين github","git hub api","github منشئين"]}},"owner":"nesihaver-IL","repo":"MyFirstRepo","repoPath":"nesihaver-IL/MyFirstRepo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-06T06:23:00.156Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-trending","description":"Fetch and display GitHub trending repositories and developers. Use when building dashboards, discovering popular projects, or tracking trending repos. Triggers on GitHub trending, popular repos, trending developers.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Trending Data\n\nFetch trending repositories and developers from GitHub.\n\n## Important Note\n\n**GitHub does NOT provide an official trending API.** This skill uses web scraping or GitHub Search API as alternatives.\n\n## Method 1: Web Scraping (Recommended)\n\n```typescript\nimport * as cheerio from ''cheerio'';\n\ninterface TrendingRepo {\n  owner: string;\n  name: string;\n  url: string;\n  description: string;\n  language: string;\n  stars: number;\n  forks: number;\n  todayStars: number;\n}\n\nasync funct","body":"# GitHub Trending Data\n\nFetch trending repositories and developers from GitHub.\n\n## Important Note\n\n**GitHub does NOT provide an official trending API.** This skill uses web scraping or GitHub Search API as alternatives.\n\n## Method 1: Web Scraping (Recommended)\n\n```typescript\nimport * as cheerio from ''cheerio'';\n\ninterface TrendingRepo {\n  owner: string;\n  name: string;\n  url: string;\n  description: string;\n  language: string;\n  stars: number;\n  forks: number;\n  todayStars: number;\n}\n\nasync function getTrendingRepos(\n  language = '''',\n  since = ''daily'' // ''daily'', ''weekly'', ''monthly''\n): Promise<TrendingRepo[]> {\n  const url = language\n    ? `https://github.com/trending/${language}?since=${since}`\n    : `https://github.com/trending?since=${since}`;\n\n  const response = await fetch(url, {\n    headers: {\n      ''User-Agent'': ''Mozilla/5.0 (compatible; TrendingBot/1.0)''\n    }\n  });\n\n  const html = await response.text();\n  const $ = cheerio.load(html);\n  const repos: TrendingRepo[] = [];\n\n  $(''article.Box-row'').each((_, element) => {\n    const $el = $(element);\n    const $title = $el.find(''h2 a'');\n    const fullName = $title.attr(''href'')?.slice(1) || '''';\n    const [owner, name] = fullName.split(''/'');\n\n    const description = $el.find(''p'').text().trim();\n    const language = $el.find(''[itemprop=\"programmingLanguage\"]'').text().trim();\n\n    const starsText = $el.find(''a[href*=\"stargazers\"]'').text().trim();\n    const stars = parseNumber(starsText);\n\n    const forksText = $el.find(''a[href*=\"forks\"]'').text().trim();\n    const forks = parseNumber(forksText);\n\n    const todayStarsText = $el.find(''span.float-sm-right'').text().trim();\n    const todayStars = parseNumber(todayStarsText);\n\n    repos.push({\n      owner,\n      name,\n      url: `https://github.com${$title.attr(''href'')}`,\n      description,\n      language,\n      stars,\n      forks,\n      todayStars,\n    });\n  });\n\n  return repos;\n}\n\nfunction parseNumber(text: string): number {\n  const cleaned = text.replace(/,/g, '''');\n  const match = cleaned.match(/[\\d.]+/);\n  if (!match) return 0;\n\n  const num = parseFloat(match[0]);\n  if (text.includes(''k'')) return Math.round(num * 1000);\n  if (text.includes(''m'')) return Math.round(num * 1000000);\n  return Math.round(num);\n}\n```\n\n## Method 2: GitHub Search API\n\n```typescript\ninterface GitHubRepo {\n  name: string;\n  owner: { login: string };\n  html_url: string;\n  description: string;\n  language: string;\n  stargazers_count: number;\n  forks_count: number;\n  created_at: string;\n}\n\nasync function getTrendingViaSearch(\n  language = '''',\n  token?: string\n): Promise<GitHubRepo[]> {\n  const date = new Date();\n  date.setDate(date.getDate() - 7); // Last week\n  const since = date.toISOString().split(''T'')[0];\n\n  const query = [\n    `created:>${since}`,\n    ''stars:>100'',\n    language ? `language:${language}` : '''',\n  ].filter(Boolean).join('' '');\n\n  const headers: HeadersInit = {\n    ''Accept'': ''application/vnd.github.v3+json'',\n  };\n\n  if (token) {\n    headers[''Authorization''] = `Bearer ${token}`;\n  }\n\n  const response = await fetch(\n    `https://api.github.com/search/repositories?q=${encodeURIComponent(query)}&sort=stars&order=desc`,\n    { headers }\n  );\n\n  const data = await response.json();\n  return data.items;\n}\n```\n\n## Next.js API Route\n\n```typescript\n// app/api/trending/route.ts\nimport { NextResponse } from ''next/server'';\nimport * as cheerio from ''cheerio'';\n\nexport const dynamic = ''force-dynamic'';\n\nexport async function GET(request: Request) {\n  const { searchParams } = new URL(request.url);\n  const language = searchParams.get(''language'') || '''';\n  const since = searchParams.get(''since'') || ''daily'';\n\n  try {\n    const repos = await getTrendingRepos(language, since);\n\n    return NextResponse.json(\n      { success: true, data: repos },\n      {\n        headers: {\n          ''Cache-Control'': ''public, s-maxage=3600, stale-while-revalidate=1800'',\n        },\n      }\n    );\n  } catch (error) {\n    return NextResponse.json(\n      { success: false, error: ''Failed to fetch trending repos'' },\n      { status: 500 }\n    );\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## React Component\n\n```tsx\n''use client'';\n\nimport { useState, useEffect } from ''react'';\n\ninterface Repo {\n  owner: string;\n  name: string;\n  url: string;\n  description: string;\n  language: string;\n  stars: number;\n  todayStars: number;\n}\n\nexport function TrendingRepos() {\n  const [repos, setRepos] = useState<Repo[]>([]);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    fetch(''/api/trending'')\n      .then(res => res.json())\n      .then(data => {\n        setRepos(data.data);\n        setLoading(false);\n      });\n  }, []);\n\n  if (loading) return <div>Loading...</div>;\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"space-y-4\">\n      {repos.map(repo => (\n        <div key={repo.url} className=\"border rounded-lg p-4\">\n          <a\n            href={repo.url}\n            target=\"_blank\"\n            rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\n            className=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline font-semibold\"\n          >\n            {repo.owner}/{repo.name}\n          </a>\n\n          <p className=\"text-gray-600 mt-2\">{repo.description}</p>\n\n          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-4 mt-3 text-sm text-gray-500\">\n            {repo.language && (\n              <span className=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n                <span className=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-blue-500\" />\n                {repo.language}\n              </span>\n            )}\n\n            <span>⭐ {repo.stars.toLocaleString()}</span>\n\n            <span className=\"text-green-600\">\n              +{repo.todayStars.toLocaleString()} today\n            </span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      ))}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Caching Strategy\n\n```typescript\n// Cache for 1 hour\nconst CACHE_TTL = 3600000; // 1 hour in ms\nconst cache = new Map<string, { data: any; timestamp: number }>();\n\nasync function getCachedTrending(language: string, since: string) {\n  const key = `${language}-${since}`;\n  const cached = cache.get(key);\n\n  if (cached && Date.now() - cached.timestamp < CACHE_TTL) {\n    return cached.data;\n  }\n\n  const data = await getTrendingRepos(language, since);\n  cache.set(key, { data, timestamp: Date.now() });\n\n  return data;\n}\n```\n\n## Important Warnings\n\n1. **GitHub may change their HTML** - Monitor for breakages\n2. **Rate limiting** - Use aggressive caching (1 hour minimum)\n3. **User-Agent required** - Always include User-Agent header\n4. **CORS** - Implement server-side to avoid CORS issues\n\n## Rate Limits\n\n**Scraping**: No official limits, but be respectful\n**GitHub API**:\n- Unauthenticated: 10 requests/minute\n- Authenticated: 30 requests/minute\n\n## Resources\n\n- **GitHub Search API**: https://docs.github.com/en/rest/search\n- **Alternative Service**: https://github-trending-api.now.sh\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T07:21:43.968Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Web Scraping Agents and Developer Insights Platforms needing real-time GitHub trending data","zh":"适合需要实时 GitHub 趋势数据的 Web Scraping Agents 和 Developer Insights Platforms","ja":"Web Scraping エージェントや Developer Insights プラットフォームがリアルタイムの GitHub トレンド データを必要とする場合に最適","ko":"실시간 GitHub 트렌드 데이터가 필요한 Web Scraping 에이전트와 개발자 인사이트 플랫폼에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Scraping Web y Plataformas de Información para Desarrolladores que necesitan datos de tendencias de GitHub en tiempo real","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de scraping Web et les plateformes d''informations pour les développeurs ayant besoin de données de tendance GitHub en temps réel","de":"Ideal für Web Scraping Agenten und Entwickler Insights Plattformen, die Echtzeit-GitHub-Trending-Daten benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Scraping da Web e Plataformas de Insights de Desenvolvedores que necessitam de dados de tendências do GitHub em tempo real","ru":"Идеально для агентов веб-скрапинга и платформ аналитики разработчиков, которым требуются данные о трендах GitHub в режиме реального времени","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تسريع الويب و منصات رؤى المطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى بيانات الاتجاهات الخاصة بـ GitHub في الوقت الفعلي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to fetch trending repositories and developers from GitHub using web scraping or GitHub Search API, providing valuable insights into popular projects and developers, leveraging libraries like cheerio for HTML parsing and GitHub''s API for precise data retrieval","zh":"赋予代理从 GitHub 中获取趋势仓库和开发者数据的能力，使用网页抓取或 GitHub Search API，提供有关流行项目和开发者的有价值见解，利用类似 cheerio 的库进行 HTML 解析和 GitHub 的 API 进行精确数据检索","ja":"エージェントが Web スクレイピングまたは GitHub Search API を使用して GitHub からトレンド リポジトリと開発者を取得する機能を提供し、cheerio などのライブラリを使用した HTML パースや GitHub の API による正確なデータ取得により、人気のプロジェクトや開発者に関する貴重なインサイトを提供する","ko":"에이전트가 웹 스크레이핑 또는 GitHub Search API를 사용하여 GitHub의 트렌드 저장소 및 개발자를 가져올 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 cheerio와 같은 라이브러리를 사용한 HTML 파싱 및 GitHub의 API를 통한 정확한 데이터检索를 통해 인기 프로젝트 및 개발자에 대한寶贵한 인사이트를 제공","es":"Permite a los agentes recuperar repositorios y desarrolladores de tendencia de GitHub utilizando scraping web o la API de búsqueda de GitHub, proporcionando información valiosa sobre proyectos y desarrolladores populares, aprovechando bibliotecas como cheerio para el análisis de HTML y la API de GitHub para la recuperación precisa de datos","fr":"Permet aux agents de récupérer des référentiels et des développeurs tendance de GitHub en utilisant le scraping Web ou l''API de recherche GitHub, fournissant des informations précieuses sur les projets et les développeurs populaires, en exploitant des bibliothèques comme cheerio pour l''analyse HTML et l''API GitHub pour la récupération précise des données","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Trending-Repositorys und -Entwickler von GitHub mithilfe von Web Scraping oder der GitHub-Such-API abzurufen, wertvolle Einblicke in beliebte Projekte und Entwickler liefernd, indem Bibliotheken wie cheerio für HTML-Parsing und die GitHub-API für präzise Datenabfrage genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita agentes a buscar repositórios e desenvolvedores em tendência no GitHub usando web scraping ou a GitHub Search API, fornecendo insights valiosos sobre projetos e desenvolvedores populares, aproveitando bibliotecas como cheerio para análise de HTML e a API do GitHub para recuperação precisa de dados","ru":"Позволяет агентам получать репозитории и разработчиков, находящиеся в тренде на GitHub, используя веб-скрапинг или GitHub Search API, обеспечивая ценные сведения о популярных проектах и разработчиках, используя библиотеки, такие как cheerio для парсинга HTML и API GitHub для точной извлечения данных","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من استخراج المستودعات والمطورين الشائعة على منصة GitHub باستخدام تقنيات تسريع الويب أو واجهة برمجة تطبيقات البحث في GitHub، مع تقديم رؤى قيمة حول المشاريع والمطورين الشائعين، واستخدام مكتبات مثل cheerio لتحليل HTML وواجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub لاسترجاع البيانات بدقة"},"useCases":{"en":["Fetching trending repositories for project inspiration","Identifying top developers for collaboration opportunities","Analyzing repository metrics such as stars, forks, and language usage"],"zh":["为项目灵感而获取趋势仓库","识别顶级开发者以便合作机会","分析仓库指标，例如星数、分叉数和语言使用情况"],"ja":["プロジェクトのインスピレーションのためにトレンド リポジトリを取得する","コラボレーションの機会のためにトップ開発者を特定する","リポジトリの指標を分析する、たとえばスター数、フォーク数、言語の使用状況"],"ko":["프로젝트 영감을 위해 트렌드 저장소를 가져오는 것","협업 기회의 위해 최상위 개발자를 식별하는 것","저장소 메트릭스 분석, 예를 들어 스타 수, 포크 수, 언어 사용状況"],"es":["Recuperar repositorios de tendencia para la inspiración de proyectos","Identificar a los principales desarrolladores para oportunidades de colaboración","Analizar métricas de repositorio como estrellas, bifurcaciones y uso de lenguaje"],"fr":["Récupérer des référentiels tendance pour l''inspiration de projets","Identifier les principaux développeurs pour des opportunités de collaboration","Analyser les métriques de référentiel telles que les étoiles, les fourches et l''utilisation de la langue"],"de":["Abrufen von Trending-Repositorys für Projektinspiration","Identifizieren der Top-Entwickler für Kooperationsmöglichkeiten","Analysieren von Repository-Metriken wie Sternen, Forks und Sprachverwendung"],"pt":["Busca de repositórios em tendência para inspiração de projetos","Identificação de desenvolvedores de destaque para oportunidades de colaboração","Análise de métricas de repositórios, como estrelas, bifurcações e uso de linguagem"],"ru":["Поиск репозиториев, находящихся в тренде, для вдохновения проектов","Определение лучших разработчиков для возможностей сотрудничества","Анализ метрик репозиториев, таких как звезды, вилки и использование языка"],"ar":["استرجاع المستودعات الشائعة لتلهم المشاريع","تحديد المطورين البارزين لفرص التعاون","تحليل مقاييس المستودعات مثل النجوم والفرع والتخدام اللغوي"]},"limitations":{"en":["No official GitHub trending API available","Relies on web scraping or GitHub Search API as alternatives","May require handling rate limits and HTML structure changes"],"zh":["没有官方的 GitHub 趋势 API","依赖于网页抓取或 GitHub Search API 作为替代","可能需要处理速率限制和 HTML 结构变化"],"ja":["公式の GitHub トレンド API が利用できない","Web スクレイピングまたは GitHub Search API を代替として使用する","レート制限や HTML 構造の変更を処理する必要がある場合がある"],"ko":["공식 GitHub 트렌드 API가 사용できないこと","웹 스크레이핑 또는 GitHub Search API를 대체로 사용하는 것","속도 제한 또는 HTML 구조 변경을 처리해야 하는 경우가 있음"],"es":["No hay API oficial de tendencias de GitHub disponible","Depende del scraping web o de la API de búsqueda de GitHub como alternativas","Puede requerir el manejo de límites de velocidad y cambios en la estructura HTML"],"fr":["Pas d''API officielle de tendance GitHub disponible","Dépend du scraping Web ou de l''API de recherche GitHub comme alternatives","Peut nécessiter la gestion des limites de débit et des changements de structure HTML"],"de":["Keine offizielle GitHub-Trending-API verfügbar","Verlässt sich auf Web Scraping oder die GitHub-Such-API als Alternativen","Kann das Handhaben von Rate Limits und Änderungen der HTML-Struktur erfordern"],"pt":["Não há API oficial de tendências do GitHub disponível","Depende de web scraping ou GitHub Search API como alternativas","Pode exigir tratamento de limites de taxa e alterações na estrutura HTML"],"ru":["Нет официального трендового API GitHub","Полагается на веб-скрапинг или GitHub Search API в качестве альтернатив","Может потребовать обработку ограничений скорости и изменений в структуре HTML"],"ar":["لا تتوفر واجهة برمجة تطبيقات رسمية لاتجاهات GitHub","يعتمد على تقنيات تسريع الويب أو واجهة برمجة تطبيقات البحث في GitHub كبديل","يمكن أن يتطلب التعامل مع حدود السعة والتغيرات في هيكل HTML"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"54598c51fe4d418b9735896dc460f99f9fb93345cfdeaaceca1e0b340b93a086","qualityScore":33}');
