INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('nv-action/vllm-benchmarks/vllm-ascend-model-adapter', 'vllm-ascend-model-adapter', 'nv-action', 'vllm-benchmarks', 'community', 'vllm-ascend-model-adapter nv-action vllm-benchmarks community The vllm-ascend-model-adapter skill adapts Hugging Face or local models to run on vllm-ascend with minimal changes. It benefits developers working with AI models, providing deterministic validation and single-commit delivery. vllm-ascend-model-adapter 是一个适配 Hugging Face 或本地模型的工具，支持最小化更改、确定性验证和单次提交交付 vllm-ascend-model-adapter は Hugging Face またはローカル モデルを適応させるツールで、最小限の変更、決定的な検証、単一のコミットによる配信をサポート vllm-ascend-model-adapter는 Hugging Face 또는 로컬 모델을 적응시키는 도구로 최소한의 변경, 결정적 검증 및 단일 커밋 전달을 지원 El adaptador de modelo vllm-ascend permite adaptar modelos de Hugging Face o locales para ejecutarse en vllm-ascend con cambios mínimos L''adaptateur de modèle vllm-ascend permet d''adapter des modèles Hugging Face ou locaux pour s''exécuter sur vllm-ascend avec des changements minimaux Der vllm-ascend-Modelladapter ermöglicht die Anpassung von Hugging Face- oder lokalen Modellen für die Ausführung auf vllm-ascend mit minimalen Änderungen O vllm-ascend-model-adapter é uma ferramenta que adapta modelos para executar no vllm-ascend com facilidade vllm-ascend-model-adapter - это инструмент, который адаптирует модели для запуска на vllm-ascend с легкостью محول vllm-ascend-model-adapter هو أداة تتيح تعديل النماذج لتشغيلها على vllm-ascend بسهولة how to use vllm-ascend-model-adapter vllm-ascend-model-adapter setup guide vllm-ascend-model-adapter alternative vllm-ascend-model-adapter vs Hugging Face vllm-ascend-model-adapter install what is vllm-ascend-model-adapter vllm-ascend-model-adapter for AI agents vllm-ascend-model-adapter troubleshooting vllm-ascend-model-adapter workflow checklist vllm-ascend-model-adapter Hugging Face 模型适配 本地模型适配 AI エージェント 模型适配工具 最小化更改 确定性验证 单次提交交付 Adapts Hugging Face models to run on vllm-ascend with minimal changes Supports deterministic validation for reliable results Enables single-commit delivery for streamlined workflow Compatible with both already-supported models and new architectures Provides troubleshooting guidance through references/troubleshooting.md Includes a feature-first checklist in references/multimodal-ep-aclgraph-lessons.md vllm-ascend-model-adapter is a skill that enables adaptation of Hugging Face or local models to run on vllm-ascend, supporting both existing and new model architectures.');
